<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Kami Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc1">Usenga Unogile kama vuwandikigwe na Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maluko</para>
  <para style="toc3">Malk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Usenga Unogile kama vuwandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maluko</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Usenga Unogile kama vuwandikigwe na Maluko Usenga Unogile wandikigwe na Maluko ni chitabu chimwe mvitabu vine vili mdilagano da sambi visimulila mbuli za ugima wa Yesu Kilisito. Chila chimwe chokemigwa “usenga unogile,” manake “lagano da sambi.” Vandikigwa na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana haja viyadanganike Yesu. Usenga Unogile wandikigwe na Maluko uo mguhi ng'hani kubita usenga wandikigwe na waja wane wamwenga. Ivija yolongeka kua iyoilongole kwandikigwa mwa waja wose wane wandike, baho kama milao sitini na mitano mbaka sabidi kulawa mvumbuka ya Kilisito. Weli na ilimu wengi wotogola kua yandikigwa Loma kwambuli ya kuwagela moyo wajalusona wa Kilisito weli Loma. Maluko, ivija komanyika kama Yohana Maluko, iyo kakala mbwiga wa Mtumigwa Paulo na Banabasi mbali waihasanya na Mtumigwa Paulo ivo wailongoza na Banaba mmiyanza yao ya misheni (Sang'hano 13:13). Hamwande chidogo waita kaidi na Banaba (Sang'hano 15:37-39). Maluko ivija kakala yailumbile ng'hani na Petulo (1 Petulo 5:13). Hata kama Maluko hauonile goya ugima wa Yesu, mbali weli na ilimu wotogola kua Maluko iyo yandikile mbuli nyingi ziyaonile Petulo na kusimulila, na uwo uwo msingi mkulu wa chitabu cha Maluko. Muusenga Unogile, Maluko kagangamiza muujalusona na ufundaji wa Yesu wa chikomelezo. Chilaguso: 1. Maluko kochilongelela chitabu Lwivi 1:1-13. 2. Amala Maluko kolongelela sang'hano za Yesu viyakalile Galilaya muulwivi 1:14-8-21. 3. Labaho Maluko kalongelela mbuli ya mwanza wa Yesu kuita Yelusalemu (8:22-10-52). 4. Maluko kakomeleza kwandika mbuli za Yesu viyakalile uko Yelusalemu, hamwe na ifa na kuzilibuka kwake (11:1-16-8).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizi koligula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Uno uo mwanduso wa Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisito, Mwanage Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Usonga kama vuwandikigwe mchitabu cha Isaya mlagusi wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">“Mulungu kalonga, ‘Nomlagiza msenga wangu yakulongolele</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:2">Iyo yonda yakutandile nzila.’ <verse eid="MRK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Na dizi jake dokema kuchiwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Yolonga, ‘Mtandileni Mndewa nzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 1:3">Itandeni goya mmoyo kumbokela Mndewa yahesa!’”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Iyo msenga kakala Yohana Mbatizi kalawilila kuluwala kawalongela wanhu, “Longeni malozo genu na kugaleka na mbatizigwe, na Mulungu kowalekesela malozo genu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Wanhu kulawa isi Yudea na hanhu hose ha Yelusalemu wakala womuwinza kumtegeleza, na watogola kugalonga na kugaleka malozo gao, nayo kawabatiza muulwanda lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohana kakala kavala kivalo chitengenezigwe kwa mazoya ga mnyama yokemigwa Ngamia na mchigudi kaifunga na mkwiji wa mbende. Ndia yake ikala nzige na uki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Nayo Yohana kaligula yolonga, “Hachisogo kokwiza yeli na udaho mkulu kubita nie. Iyo nie nzakabwa tu kumwake sidaha hata kumfulila nzabi za mikwabazi yake. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Nie nombatizeni kwa mazi, mbali iyo kombatizeni kwa Muhe wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobatizigwa na kugezigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13">Matayo 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luka 3:21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4:1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mazua gago Yesu keza kulawa kae ya Nazaleti ya Galilaya, kavika kwa Yohana nayo kambatiza muulwanda lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yesu viyakalile kolawa mmazi, kaona ulanga wogubuka na Muhe wa Mulungu kamuhulumukila kama vija hua. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Na dizi kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu dihulikigwa dolonga, “Gweye iyo mwanangu wa wende ininogeligwe ng'hani.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Bahaja Muhe wa Mulungu kamlongoza Yesu kuita kuchiwala, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />nayo kakala uko mazua alobaini, kuno kogezigwa na Mwenembago. Uko kakala na wanyama wa kuimbago, nawo Watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wakala womsang'hanila.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema wavula somba wane wamuwinze</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matayo 4:12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luka 4:14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Mmazua mengi vigabitile Yohana kagogigwa na kwikigwa mchifungo. Hamwande Yesu kaita kae ya Galilaya na kasonga kuligula Usenga unogile wa Mulungu, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />kalonga, “Chipindi chivika, na chipindi cha Mulungu kulongoza chahabehi! Mgalonge na kugaleka malozo genu, na kuutogola Usenga Unogile!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Zua dimwe Yesu viyakalile yogenda hamgwazo mwa bahali ya Galilaya kawaona wavula somba waidi Simoni na Andilea ndugu yake wakala wovua somba na lwavu lwao. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu kawalongela, “Niwinzeni, na nie nomfundani mnigalile wanhu kama vija vumkala movula somba.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Bahaja waleka nyavu zao wamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Viyagendile hamwande chidogo kawaona Yakobo na Yohana wanage Zebedayo. Wakala muingalawa yao wosasala nyavu zao. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Bahaja Yesu kawakema wamuwinze, nawo wamleka Zebedayo tata yao muingalawa na waja watumigwa wa kulihigwa, nawo wamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komlava munhu chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka 4:31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Amala Yesu na waluko wake wagoga nzila mbaka Kapelinaumu, vidivikile zua da kuhumula da Wayahudi wengila mwi ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila ya Wayahudi na kasonga kuwafunda. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Wanhu wakanganya ng'hani kwa vija viyafunda, manake kakala yowafunda kama munhu yolalika, mbali si kama wafundaaji wao wa ndagizi za Musa.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Bahaja, kengila munhu mwing'anda ya kuiting'hanila yakalile yambule chinyamkela nayo kakala yoguta nyangi yolonga, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“China choni nagweye, Yesu ulawa Mnazaleti? Ivo, kwiza kuchibananga? Nokumanya gweye kwa nani, gweye iyo wikigwe uiyeka kulawa kwa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Mbali Yesu kamkomhokela ija chinyamkela, na kamlongela, “Nyamala hupi na umlawe munhu ino!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Iyo chinyamkela kamtigisa tigisa kwa ludabwa na kaguta kwa dizi kulu, amala kamlawa munhu ija. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Wanhu wose wakanganya, na kuiuza wenyego kwa wenyego, “Chino choni? Uno ufundaji waiyeka uli na laliko. Manake munhu ino kowalakila hata vinyamkela nawo womtegeleza!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ivo mbuli zake zenela hima chila hanhu mziisi zili behi na Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matayo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Labaho Yesu na waluko wake Simon na Andulea na Yohana na Yakobo viwalawile mwing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi, wavika muikae ya Simoni na Andilea. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Mama nkoi wa Simoni kakala mtamu wa mdikomwa, kolumwa homa, na bahaja viyavikile wamlongela Yesu mbuli iyo. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Ivo Yesu kamuwinza, kamgoga mkono na kamwinula. Baho homa ikunguzuka, nayo kasonga kuwasang'hanila.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Mchigulogulo zua da kuhumula vidimalile, wanhu wamgalila watamu wose na waja wambule vinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Wanhu wengi wa kae ija waikunzanya hamwe hanze ya lwivi lwa ng'anda. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Yesu kawahonya wanhu wengi wakalile na chila chitamu na kawalava vinyamkela wengi. Mbali hawalekile walonge chochose kwavija wammanya iyo nani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koligula uko Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka 4:42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mitondo yake lukwili, kabula zua kusimbuka, Yesu kalawa kaita hanhu halibule munhu yoyose kakala baho kupula. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na wayage waita kumzambwila Yesu kuyeli, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />na viwamonile wamlongela kua, “Kila munhu kokuzambwila gweye.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu kawedika kawalongela, “Chiteni mmabululu gamwenga galibehi na Galilaya, mhate kuligula Usenga wa Mulungu uko, manake icho chinizile.” <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Kwaivo kazunguluka Galilaya yose, kuno kuligula mnaizing'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kuwalava vinyamkela.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yeli na utamu wa dikulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matayo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Munhu imwe yeli na utamu wa dikulu kamwizila Yesu, katumbala mavindi kampula, kamlongela, “Wahalonda kodaha kuninang'hana.” <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu kamonela bazi kulu, kagolosa mkono wake kamwamha. Kamlongela, “Nolonda, unang'hane!” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Bahaja utamu wa dikulu umlawa, kanang'hana. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Amala Yesu kamgoma ng'hani, na kamleka asegele hima aite <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />kwa kumlongela, “Kolondeka sekeumlongele munhu yoyose mbuli zino. Mbali genda ukailaguse kwa mlava nhambiko ili kuwagangamizila kua kuhonyigwa. Na ukalave nhambiko kama viyalalike Musa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Mbali munhu ija kalawa na kasonga kulonga chila hanhu vija viyahonyigwe. Kwaivo Yesu kapotigwa kwingila mzikae kaidi bila kifiso badili yake kalonda hanhu halibule wanhu kakala baho. Mbali wanhu wang'hali womzambwila uko na uko kuyali kila ubanzi.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matayo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Chipindi chidodo chibita Yesu kabwela kae ya Kapelinaumu, wanhu wahulika kua kabwela ukae. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Ivo wanhu wengi wammemela mbaka haulwivi hakala habule nyafasi yoyose yakubita! Nayo Yesu kakala yoligula usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Ivo wanhu wamgalila Yesu munhu yaholole, yakalile yapapigwe na wanhu wane. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Mbali wapotigwa kumvikiza kwa Yesu kubitila haulwivi kwavija wanhu wakala wamema. Ivo wakwela kuchanha kuchiswili na watobola zonzo hachanha ha haja hayakalile Yesu, wamhulumusa kwa nzabi ija mtamu yaholole yeli mchilago chiagonele. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu viyaonile vija viwamtogole, kamlongela ija mtamu yaholole, “Mwanangu, nikulekesela malozo gako.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Wafunda ndagizi za Musa wamwenga wakalile haja waitonga mbuli iyo mmoyo, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Habali munhu ino kolonga vino? Ino komfukula Mulungu! Yelihi yodaha kulekesa malozo ga munhu badili ya Mulungu yaiyeka?”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Bahaja Yesu kavimanya viwatonga mmoyo, nayo kawalongela, “Habali motonga ivo mmoyo? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Mbuli ibuhile ilihi, kumlongela ino mtamu wa kuholola, ‘Nikulekesela malozo gako,’ hebu kulonga, ‘Ima, usole chilago chako uite?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Nolonda kuwagangamizila kua nie Mwana wa Munhu ninao udaho wa kuwalekesela wanhu malozo gao muiisi.” Yesu kamlongela ija mtamu, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nokulongela, ima, usole chilago chako uite ukae yako.”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Bahaja ija mtamu wa kuholola kema, kasola chilago chake kaita kuno wanhu womlola! Mbuli ino iwakanganya wose, wamtogola Mulungu, walonga, “Mbuli kama ino hachinaiona mbee!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Lawi yamuwinze</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matayo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu kaita kaidi mgwazogwazo mwa Lamba da Galilaya. Bumbila kulu da wanhu dimuwinza, nayo kasonga kuwafunda. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Viyakalile yogenda, kamuona Lawi mwana wa Alifayo kakala hanhu hakukunzanyila kodi, kamlongela, “Niwinze.” Lawi kema, kamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Amala Yesu viyakalile yoja ndia muing'anda ya Lawi, Wagoga kodi wengi na weli na malozo wakala woja hamwe nayo na waluko wake, manake hakala na wanhu wengi wakalile womuwinza. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Wafunda ndagizi wamwenga weli Mafalisayo viwamonile Yesu yoja na wagoga kodi na wamwenga wamanyike kua weli na malozo, wawauza waja waluko wa Yesu, “Habali Yesu koja na wagoga kodi na waja wamanyike kua weli na malozo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yesu viyahulike gago gawalonga kawawedika, “Welina ugima hawalonda mlaguzi, mbali watamu wolonda mlaguzi. Sizile kuwakema waja watogoligwe na Mulungu, badili yake niza kwa mbuli ya weli na malozo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ufundaji wa sambi kuhanganya na ufundaji wa mwaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matayo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Waluko wa Yohana na waja wa Mafalisayo wakala wofunga. Wanhu wamwenga wamuwinza Yesu na kumuuza, “Mbona waluko wa Yohana na wa Mafalisayo wofunga mbali waluko wako hawofunga?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu kawedika, “Wagonekigwe na mwenye zengele wodahaze kufunga wahawa hamwe na mwenye zengele? Kwavija mwenye zengele kahamwe nawo, hawodaha kufunga. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Mbali chipindi chokwiza ija mwenye zengele yahalavigwa kumwao, baho leka wafunge.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Habule munhu yosonela chilaka cha sambi mchivalo cha mwaka. Yahatenda ivo, kija chilaka cha sambi chokidega chivalo cha mwaka, na haja hasonigwe hokongezeka kudegeka. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Ivija habule munhu yogida divai ya sambi mmifuko ya mbende ya mwaka. Yahatenda ivo, ija divai ya sambi yoitula ija mifuko ya mbende ya mwaka, kwaivo divai yokwitika na mifuko ya mbende ya mwaka yobanangika. Ivo divai ya sambi yokwikigwa mmifuko ya sambi.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu iyo Mndewa wa zua da kuhumula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matayo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Mdizua dimwe da kuhumula da Wayahudi, Yesu kakala yobita hagati ya mmigunda ya ndia kama ya uhemba yeli na waluko wake. Viwakalile wobita waja waluko wake wakala wokwanyula makwamvi gake. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafalisayo wamuuza, “Lola, mbona waluko wako wotenda mbuli igomigwe kutendigwa mdizua da Kuhumula?” <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu kawedika, “Ivo hamsomile mmayandiko ga Mulungu bule viyatendile Daudi na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Daudi kengila Muing'anda ya Mulungu Abiasali viyakalile mkulu wa walava nhambiko, kaija ija migate ikigwe kwambuli ya Mulungu, ija igomigwe kujigwa na wanhu wamwenga ila walava nhambiko waiyeka, nayo kaweng'ha na wayage.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Zua da kuhumula dikigwa na Mulungu kwambuli ya kuwataza wanhu, mbali si wanhu wadunhunzike kwa Zua ijo. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Nie Mwana wa Munhu iyo Mndewa wa Zua da kuhumula.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya Munhu mdizua da Kuhumula</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matayo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Zua dimwenga da Kuhumula Yesu kengila mgati ya ng'anda ya kuiting'hanila da Wayahudi na umo kukala munhu imwe yeli na mkono uholole. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wakalile umo wakala womlola wamone kama kodaha kumhonya mdizua da kuhumula, ili wadahe kumwing'ha mbuli yakumgala mchitala. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu kamlongela ija yeli na mkono uholole, “Izo hano hagati.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Amala Yesu kawauza, “Ivo, dilihi dilondeka mdizua da kuhumula, kusang'hana dinogile hebu dihile, kuhonya ugima hebu kukoma?” Mbali wao wanyamala hupii. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu kawalola wose kwa ludoko, kagwa giogio ng'hani kwambuli ya udala wao wa kutogola. Baho kamlongela ija munhu yeli na mkono uholole, “Golosa mkono wako!” Mtamu ija kaugolosa, nawo mkono uhona kabisa! <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Mafalisayo walawa kunze, waiting'hana hamwe na wajalusona wa Helode walonda nzila ya kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabumbila ga wanhu gomuinza Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Nayo Yesu na waja waluko wake, wahalawa wainega waita kudilamba. Bumbila da wanhu diwawinza, kulawa Galilaya, na Yudea. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Wanhu wahulika gaja gayasang'hane, ivo wamwenga kulawa Yelusalemu na kulawa Idumeya na vijiji vili mgwazo ya lwanda lwa Yolodani, ivija na waja wakalile behi na Tilo na Sidoni, wamuwinza Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Ivo Yesu kawalongela waja waluko wake watande goya ngalawa ndodo aitumile, ili wanhu seke wamsung'hesung'he kwavija hakala na bumbila kulu da wanhu. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kwavija kakala kawahonya wanhu wengi, ivo watamu wakala woisung'ha sung'ha wapate kumwamha ili wahonyigwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Mala zose wanhu wambule vinyamkela wahamwona, wogwa hasi mmagulu gake na kuguta nyangi wolonga, “Gweye iyo mwana wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Mbali Yesu kawakomhokela seke wamlonge kwa wanhu kua iyo nani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kasagula wanhu kumi na waidi kua Wasenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matayo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Amala Yesu kakwela kulugongo, kawakema waja yawasagule mwenyego, nawo wamuwinza. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Nayo kawasagula kumi na waidi wao ivija kawakema Wasenga,kawalongela, “Nimsaguleni mweye mkale na nie.” Na ivija kawalongela, “Nomtumani ili mkaligule, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />na kupata udaho wa kulava wanhu vinyamkela.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Mazina ga waja kumi na waidi wasaguligwe na Yesu ni Simoni, iyo yamkemile Petulo, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />na Yakobo na Yohana wanage Zebedayo, yawakemile Bonalije, maana ya zina ijo wabwanga wa Mdumo, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />na Andulea na Filipo na Batulomayo na Matayo na Tomasi na Yakobo mwanage Alfayo, na Tadayo na Simoni mgombela isi yake, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda munhu kulawa kae ya Kaliote ija amala keza kumhinduka Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mkulu kubita Belizebuli</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matayo 12:22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12:10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Baho Yesu kabwela ukae. Wanhu wengi waiting'hana kaidi, nayo kakala yowasang'hanila mbaka yeye na waluko wake wapotigwa kuja ndia. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ndugu zake viwahulike galawilile weza kumsola kwavija wanhu wakala wolonga, “Kengila kichala.” <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Wafunda ndagizi za Musa walawile Yelusalemu walonga, “Yesu kambula Belizebuli! Mkulu wa vinyamkela, iyo yomwing'ha udaho wa kuwalava wanhu vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Baho Yesu kawakema na kulonga nao kwa mifano, “Ivo Mwenembago kodahaze kuiwinga mwenyego? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Kama wanhu wa ufaume umwe wahagomba wenyengo, ufaume uo wogwa, <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />ivija wanhu wa kae imwe ihaigola yenyego kwa yenyego, kae iyo haima. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Nayo Mwenembago yahaihinduka mwenyego kwa kuigola, hadaha kwima mbali kovika muuhelelo.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Habule munhu yoyose yodaha kwingila mwikae ya munhu yeli na ludabwa mkulu na kumboka vinhu vake bila kumgela nzabi ija yeli na ludabwa, na yahamgela nzabi lekaivo yamboke vinhu vake. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Yesu kawalongela, kweli nowalongela, malozo gose gomsang'hana na kufukula kwenu, kolekesigwa. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Mbali yoyose yomfukula Muhe wa Mulungu halekeseligwa mbee, lozo ijo hadilekesigwa mazua gose galibule uhelelo.” <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu kalonga ivo kwavija wanhu wakala wolonga, “Kambula mwenembago.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walukolo wakweli wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matayo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Walukolo wake na mamiyake Yesu weza na wema hanze, wamtumila usenga yalawe kuze. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Wanhu wengi wamema wamzunguluka kumtegeleza, msenga ija keza kalonga, “Mami yako na walukolo wako wahanze, wokulonda.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mami yangu na ndugu zangu iyo nani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Amala Yesu kawalola waja wanhu wakalile wamzunguluke ubanzi wose, kalonga, tegelezeni, “Mami yangu na walukolo wangu iyo wano wakalile hano! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Munhu yoyose yosang'hana goyolonda Mulungu, iyo iyo mkulu wangu, na lumbu jangu na mami yangu.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa munhu yohanda mbeyu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matayo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu kasonga kuwafunda kaidi mgwazo mwa lamba da Galilaya. Wanhu wengi waikunzanye kumzunguluka ivo wamtenda Yesu yengile muingalawa ikalile baho mummgwazo mwa lamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Kakala kowafunda mbuli nyingi kwa mifano, na kawalongela,<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Tegelezeni! Munhu imwe kaita kuhanda mbeyu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Viyakalile yomiza, mbeyu zimwenga zilagalila nzila, ndege weza wazidonda wazija. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Zimwenga zilagalila muulongo uli na mabwe halibule ulongo mwingi. mbeyu zilopola kota, kwavija hakala habule ulongo mwingi, <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />mbali zua vidilawile ng'hani, mbeyu izo zihomba na zinyala kwavija mizizi yake haingile ng'hani muulongo. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mbeyu zimwenga zilagalila mmiwa, miwa ikula izizonga mbeyu izo zotile zipotigwa kulela mhule. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Mbeyu zimwenga zilagala muulongo unogile, zota vinogile na zikula, zilela na zilava mhule, zimwenga zilela salasini, zimwenga sitini na zimwenga zilela mia.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Amala Yesu kalonga, “Yeli na magutwi ga kuhulika na yahulige ganilonga.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habali Yesu kofunda kwa mfano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matayo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka 8:9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Yesu viyakalile yaiyeka, waluko wake kumi na waidi weli hamwe na wanhu wamwenga wamuwinza na kumlongela yawafambulile mifano yake. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Nayo Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mwing'higwa udahi wa kumanya difisigwe muufaume wa Mulungu, mbali kwa waja weli kunze kila chinhu kumwao nowalongela kwa mifano <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />ili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">‘walole kwakugangamiza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">mbali sekewaone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">wahulike vinogile ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">mbali seke wavimanye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">Ama ivo, wahamhindukile Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 4:12">nayo yahawalekesele malozo gao.’”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowafambulila mfano wa mlimi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matayo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Amala Yesu kawauza, “Kama hamuumanyile mfano uno? Modahaze kuimanya mifano imwenga? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mhandaji ija wa mbeyu nikama munhu yoligula usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Mbeyu zilagale nzila, iyo waja wanhu wohulika usenga wa Mulungu, bahaja Mwenembago kokwiza na kusola uja usenga uhandigwe mmwao. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Mbeyu zilagalile muulongo uli na mabwe, iyo waja wanhu wohauhulika usenga wa Mulungu, bahaja woubokela kwa ndeng'helo. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Mbali kama ija mimela yabule mizizi mitali usenga wa Mulungu haukala mmoyo, kwavija magazo na madununzo gaheza kwambuli ya usenga uo woleka kuutogola. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Mbeyu zilagalile mmiwa, iyo waja wanhu wouhulika usenga wa Mulungu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />mbali mahunganiko ga muiisi ino, kulonda vinhu na maya ya mbuli zimwenga vihawengila vouzonga usenga uli mmwao na hawadaha kuusang'hanila sang'hano usenga uo. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Mbeyu zilagalile muulongo uli na lutuba, iyo waja wanhu wohulika uja usenga wa Mulungu, woubokela na kuusang'hanila mbuli nyingi zinogile kama zija mbeyu wamwenga salasini na wamwenga sitini na wamwenga mia ya ija ihandigwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lumuli lugubikigwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka 8:16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu kagendelela kuwalongela, “Ivo, munhu kodaha kubwinha lumuli na kuugubika mdidebe hebu muuvungu wa komwa? Habule, mbali wokwikigwa haichingolobweda. <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ivija habule mbuli ifisigwe sekeivumbuligwe hebu mbuli yoyose igubikigwe seke igubuligwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Uhawa na magutwi ga kuhulika, na uhulike ganilonga!<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Amala kawalongela, “Muitiganye ng'hani, vija vumuilavile kutegeleza usenga, ivo Mulungu viyakutenda uumanye, kaidi Mulungu kokutenda umanye ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Manake ija munhu yotegeleza usenga wa Mulungu na kuumanya, Mulungu komtaza na kumtenda aumanya ng'hani.” Kama munhu hategeleza usenga wa Mulungu, hata chija chidodo chiachimanya cha usenga wa Mulungu chobokigwa.<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa mbeyu ikota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga,“Ufaume wa Mulungu uilinga vino. Munhu imwe kamiza mbeyu kumgunda. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Yahamala kumiza mbeyu, chila zua misi na chilo, viyawasile na kulamka, mbeyu yokota na kukula bila iyo kuvimanya mbeyu viikota nakukula. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ikala ivo kwavija ulongo wenyego wokoteza mbeyu, amala mayani na mbelewele, amala uhule mdikwamvi. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Amala uhemba uhakangala, mlimi kokwingila mumgunda na mundu jake da kusengela manake mulao uvika.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfano wa mbyeyu ya Haladali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31">Matayo 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luka 13:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yesu kawauza, “Ivo chiulinge na choni ufaume wa Mulungu? Hebu mfano ulihi wakuilinga nawo chiusimulile umanyike? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Uilinga na mbeyu ya haladali, ihahandigwa muulongo iyo mbeyu ndodo ng'hani kubita mbeyu zose zili muiisi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Mbali yahota, yokula na yokua mbiki mkulu kubita yose ili mdikonde, uli na makwamvi makulu mbaka ndege wozenga mvulu zao mgamakwamvi gake.<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Kwamifano imwenga mingi kama ino Yesu kalonga nao Usenga wake, kwa vija viwovimanya. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yesu halongile nao mbuli yoyose bila mifano. Mbali viyakalile na waluko wake, wao kawafambulila chila chinhu.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kadikomhokela beho kulu mdilamba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matayo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Mchigulogulo mdizua ijo, Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, “Chiloke chite mbaka umwambu mwa lamba.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Waluko wake wadileka dija bumbila, wengila muingalawa iyakalile Yesu wasegela nayo. Na wanhu wengila mzingalawa zimwenga wailongoza nao. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Bahaja halawila beho kulu mdilamba, digala ng'humbi da mazi ditoile ngalawa ija iyakalile Yesu mbaka ikala yomema mazi mgati. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Yesu kakala yawasile mgati hachisogo mwingalawa kuno kasigamiza ditwi jake mchilago. Waluko wake wamlamsa, wamlongela, “Mfundaji, hugesa kama chofa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu kalamka, kadikomhokela beho dija, kadidikomhokela dija ng'humbi da mazi, “Nyamala hupi!” Bahaja, beho dinyamala, na lamba dikala na utindiwala mkulu. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, “Habali modumba ivo? Ivo, mng'hali hamtogola?” <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Nawo waluko wake wakala wadumbile ng'hani, waiuza, “Yelihi ino mbaka beho na ng'humbi da mazi vomtegeleza?<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya munhu yambule Vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matayo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yesu na waluko wake wavika umwambu wa lamba da Galilaya muiisi ya Wagelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yesu viyalawile muingalawa, bahaja waiting'hanila na munhu imwe yolawila mgamapanga. Munhu iyo kakala yambule Chinyamkela. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Munhu iyo kakala yokala mgamapanga, na habule munhu yodaha kumkimila na kwakumfunga loda. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Mala nyingi kakala yafungigwe kwa loda magulu na makono, mbali kozidumula na kukanha zija zikalile mmagulu gake. Hahawile na munhu yoyose yadahile kumkimila. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Misi na chilo kakala kohembwegela mgamapanga na mvigongo, koguta nyangi na kuikanha kwa mabwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Viyamonile Yesu kwa kutali, kamkimbilila na kamtumbalila. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Kaguta kwa dizi kulu kalonga, “Habali wingilila mbuli zangu, Yesu, mwanage Mulungu yeli kuchanha ng'hani? Nokupula kwa zina da Mulungu, seke undununze!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Kalonga ivo kwavija Yesu kakala kamkomhokela, “Chinyamkela mlekese munhu ino!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Baho Yesu kamuuza, “Zina jako nani?” Ija munhu kamwidika, “Zina jangu bumbila da wamilizi, manake cha wengi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Amala waja vinyamkela wampula ng'hani Yesu seke yawalave muiisi ija. <verse eid="MRK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Behi na baho hakala na bumbila da nguluwe dikalile dosusiligwa muinhelemko ya lugongo. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Baho waja vinyamkela wampula Yesu walonga, “Chokupula ng'hani chileke chiite chikawengile nguluwe waja.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu kawaleka waite, nawo waita kuwengila nguluwe waja. Bumbila dija da nguluwe, dihulumukila muingema na dingila mdilamba na difila mmazi. Na bumbila dija da nguluwe dovika kama elufu mbili.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Walolesi wa nguluwe waja wakimbilila mzikae na mvijiji kuwalongela mbuli iyo. Wanhu walawa kuita kulola gago galawilile. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Viwamvikile Yesu, wamuona ija munhu yakalile na bumbila da vinyamkela, kakala yavalile vivalo na yeli na umanyi wake wenele. Nao wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Waja wagaonile gago wawalongela wanhu wao gaja gamlawile ija yakalile na vinyamkela na dija bumbila da nguluwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Baho wanhu wasonga kumpula ng'hani Yesu yahalawe muiisi yao.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Baho Yesu viyakalile yokwingila muingalawa, ija munhu yakalile kambula vinyamkela kampula wailongoze.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Mbali Yesu hamtogolele ila kamlongela, “Genda ukae yako ukawalongele walukolo wako gaja gayakutendele Mndewa Mulungu na viyakuonele bazi.<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ivo munhu ija kahalawa kaita kuwalongela uko Dakapoli, maana yake isi ya kae kumi, vija Yesu viyamtendele, nawo wanhu wakanganyika ng'hani.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komzilibula Biti Yailo na kumhonya Muke imwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matayo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu viyamalile kuloka umwambu, viyakalile hamgwazo mwa lamba bumbila kulu da wanhu dimzingila. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Amala imwe wa vilongozi wa ng'anda za kuiting'hanila wayahudi yakemigwe Yailo, kavika haja na viyamuonile Yesu katumtumbalila mavindi, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />kampula kamlongela, “Biti yangu mtamu lagalaga. Chonde chonde nokupula izo umwikile makono gako mditwi umpulile utamu wake uhone.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Baho Yesu kailongoza nayo. Bumbila kula da wanhu diwawinza, wakala womzonga.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Baho hakala na muke yakalile na utamu wa kuzinga ngata kwa milao kumi na midi. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Muke iyo kakala kodununzika ng'hani na kahunganika kwa walaguzi wengi na katumila kila chinhu chiyelinacho yapate kuhona badili yake utamu umzamila ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mbali viyahulike mbuli ziyatendile Yesu nayo keza hachisogo ha Yesu mdibumbila da wanhu, kamha mhindo ya Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />ivo kailongela mmoyo wake, “Kama nihadaha kwamha mhindo yake tu, nohona.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Bahaja utamu wake wakuzinga ngata kukanha, nayo kaona lukuli lwake luhona kabisa. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Baho Yesu kavimanya udaho wake ulawa na uhonya. Kadihindukila dija bumbila da wanhu na kawauza, “Yelihi yanyamhile mhindo yangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Waluko wake wamwidika, “Koona wanhu viwakumemele vino amala kouzaze, ‘Yelihi yakwamhile?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Mbali Yesu kapelesa ubanzi wose yamlole yelihi yamwamhile. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Ija muke, kuno kokimanya chimlawilile, keza yogudema kwa Yesu kuno kodumba na kamgwila mmagulu gake, kamlongela gose gamlawilile. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu kamlongela, “Biti yangu tumanilo jako dikuhonya. Genda kwa utindiwala, na utamu wako seke ukubwelele.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga, wanhu wavika kulawa ukae kwa Yailo wamlongela, “Biti yako kadanganika habali ung'hani komgaza mfundaji?”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Mbali Yesu hawagesile gaja gawalonga, ivo kamlongela ija mkulu wa ng'anda yakuiting'hanila, “Seke udumbe, gwee togola tu.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Ivo hamlekile munhu yoyose yamuwinze badili ya Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana mdodoake Yakobo. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Viwavikile ukae kwa Yailo, Yesu kaona tulikizi, wanhu wolila chaka, weli na ndilo ili na kulombokeza ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Baho Yesu kengila mng'anda, kawalongela, “Habali mogala tulikizi kuno molila? Mwana ino hadanganike ila kawasa tu.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Waja wanhu wamseka kwa kumzeha. Mbali Yesu kawalava kunze wose kuyawasile ija mwana, kawasola tata na mami yake imwana na waja waluko wake wadatu yelinao. Wengila mng'anda mbaka hayeli ija mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Kamwamha mkono ija mwana na kamlongela, “Talita kumi!” Manake, “Biti, nokulongela lamuka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Bahaja biti ija kalamka kema, na kasonga kugenda Mwana iyo kakala na ukulu wa milao kumi na midi. Nao viwagaone gago gawakanganya ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesu kawalagiza kwa kugangamiza seke wamlongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino. Na ivija kawalongela wamwing'he ndia ija mwana yaje.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa Nazaleti womlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matayo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu kahalawa uko Kapelinaumu na kaita ukae yake kuyakulile, kuno yoilongoza na waluko wake. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Vidivikile zua da kuhumula, kasonga kuwafunda wanhu muing'anda ya kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na wanhu wengi viwahulike ivo viwakanganya ng'hani. Waiuza, “Munhu ino kapatahi mbuli zino zose? Lola nzewele ya vilihi yeng'higwe? Lola kwa udaho wavilihi kodaha kusang'hana mbuli za uzonza kama zino! <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Ino si ija Msongolaji mwanage Maliamu? Na walukolo wake si Yakobo na Yusufu na Yuda na Simoni? Na Lumbu zake wose si chinao hano hamwetu?” Nao wamzeleu ng'hani kwa mbuli iyo na waleka kumtumanila.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mlagusi wa Mulungu kotogoligwa kumwenga kose mbali hatogoligwa na wanhu waukae yake na walukolo wake na waja waleligwe hamwe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Hatendile miuzonza yoyose uko mbali kawekila makono watamu wadodo tu na kawahonya. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Nayo kakanganyigwa ng'hani vija wanhu hawamtogole.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu kawalagiza waja kumi na waidi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matayo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Yesu kakala yogenda chijiji chimwe mbaka chimwenga kuno kowafunda. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Kawakema waluko waja kumi na waidi, kaweng'ha udaho wa kulava wanhu vinyamkela na kawalagiza waite waidi waidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Kawalagiza kwa kuwalongela, “Sekemsole chochose muumwanza mbali mkongojo tu. Sekemsole mhamba, hebu kadi, hebu sente mmikwiji yenu. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mvale makwabaza, mbali sekemsole chivalo chimwenga cha kusaula.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Amala kawalongela, “Mhengila muing'anda yoyose, kaleni umo mbaka muhalawa muikae iyo. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Kama hanhu hohose hawawabokele hebu kuwategeleza, laweni umo, na kung'huseni timbwisi dili mmagulu genu, icho chokua chilaguso kua Mulungu kowenukila kwavija hawawategeleze.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kwaivo walawa na kuligula kua wanhu wolondeka kulonga na kugaleka malozo gao. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Wakala wolava vinyamkela wengi, wawabaka mavuta watamu wengi na kuwahonya.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufa kwa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matayo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Mfaume Helode kahulika mbuli zino, manake zina da Yesu dimanyika chila hanhu. Wanhu wamwenga wakala wolonga, “Yohana Mbatizi kazilibuka na udaho wa kutenda uzonza wamgati womlongoza kwavija iyo Mlagusi wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Wamwenga walonga, “Ino Eliya.” Nawo wamwenga walonga, “Iyo Mlagusi wa Mulungu imwenga, iyo kati ya waja Walagusi wa Mulungu wamwenga waumwaka.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Mbali Helode viyahulike mbuli zino, kalonga, “Ino Yohana Mbatizi, inimkanhile ditwi kazilibuka.” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Helode kalonga ivo kwavija kakala kalagiza Yohana Mbatizi yagogigwe, yageligwe mdigeleza. Nayo katenda vino kwa vija Helode kakala yafungile zengele na Helodia, mwehe wa Filipo mkulu wake. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Helode kamtendela ivo Yohana, kwavija kakala yamlongele Helode, havinogile gweye kufunga zengele na mwehe wa mkulu wako.<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Kwaivo Helodia kakala yamwikile fundogolo Yohana kalonda kumkoma, mbali hadahile, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />kwavija Helode kakala yomkimila. Helode kakala yomdumba Yohana kwavija kavimanya Yohana ni munhu yanogile na yotogoligwa na Mulungu, ivo Helode kengila giogio ng'hani viyahulike Yohana ziyalonga, mbali kang'hali yolonda kumtegeleza. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Zua dimwe Mfaume Helode katanda lusona mkulu, kwa ng'humbukizi ya zua diyavumbuke. Kawagoneka waja wakulu wa walongozi wake, Wakulu wa majeshi na wanhu watogoligwa ng'hani mui kae ya Galilaya, baho lelo Helodia kapata nyafasi yaigozele mazua mengi. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Biti yake Helodia viyengile na kuvina, Helode kadeng'helelea na waja wagonekigwe wakalile mui ndia. Mfaume Helode kamulongela biti yake, “Mhule jojose duulonda, nanie nokwing'ha.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Kaidi kailahila na kumulongela, “Chochose chuupula nokwing'ha, hata kama nusu ya wa ufaume wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Biti ija kalawa hanze kaita kumuuza mami yake, “Mhule choni?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Mami yake kamwidika kamlongela,”Pula ditwi da Yohana Mbatizi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Biti ija kalopola kabwela kwa Mfaume na kamlongela, “Nolonda uning'he sambi baha ditwi da Yohana Mbatizi mditanda!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mfaume kagwa giogio ng'hani kwa mbuli iyo, mbali kwavija kakala yailahile na kaidi haulongozi ha waja wagonekigwe ivo halondile kumlemela. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Bahaja mfaume kamlagiza mwamilizi wake imwe yakamkane ditwi Yohana muja mdigeleza akigale hamwake. Ija mwamilizi kaita mdigeleza kamkanha ditwi Yohana Mbatizi, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />baho kadigala dija ditwi da Yohana mditanda na kumwing'ha biti ija, nayo biti kamgalila mami yake. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Waluko wake Yohana viwahulike mbuli iyo, weza kuusola mtufi wake na waita kuuwanda.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaweng'ha ndia wanhu elufu tano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Waja waluko wa Yesu wabwela na kuiting'hanila kwa Yesu na wamlongela mbuli ziwasang'hane na kufunda. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Baho kwa vija wanhu wengi ng'hani wakala wokwingila umo na kulawa, kakala yowasang'hanila mbaka wopotigwa kupata nyafasi ya kuja ndia, Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, “Chiteni chiinege chiiyeka hanhu haifisile, chipate kuhumula chidogo.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Ivo wasegela kwa kutumila ngalawa yao waiyeka waita hanhu haifisile halibule wanhu.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Mbali wanhu wengi wawaona viwosegela, wawamanya kuwaita, nawo walopola kuwalongolela kwa magulu, kulawa mzikae zose, na walopola kuvika kabula yao. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Yesu viyalawile kulawa mui ngalawa kadiona bumbila kulu da wanhu, kawaonela ubazi manake wakala kama bung'hukilalo walibule msusilaji. Kwaivo kasonga kuwafunda mbuli nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Zua vidiswele, waluko wake wamuwinza Yesu, wamlongela, “Hanhu hano habule wanhu na zua diswa ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Walage wanhu ili wadahe kuita mzikae na mvijiji vili behi, waigulile ndia.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Weng'heni mweye ndia.” Waja waluko wamlongela Yesu, “Hachidaha kugula migate ya kuwenela wahu wano wose, hata chihawa na dinali mia mbili.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:37 </char></note> Kwa chipindi icho dinali mia mbili ni sente za kwenela kumliha munhu imwe kwa miezi minane. <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Kawauza, “Kuna migate mingahi? Gendeni mkalole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Viwamalile kulola wabwela, na wamlongela, “Hana migate mitano na somba waidi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Amala Yesu kawalagiza waluko wake wawagole wanhu wakale vilundo mmayani, <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />ivo wanhu wakala wamwenga wanhu mia na wamwenga hamsini hamsini. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesu kaisola ija migate mitano na waja somba waidi amala kalola kuulanga kwa Mulungu, kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu amala kaibanzula ija migate, kaweng'ha waluko wake wawagolele waja wanhu wose. Na ivija kaweng'ha waluko wake wawagolele waja somba waidi wanhu wose. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Wanhu wose waja, na weguta. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Waluko wake wakunzanya vihande visigale va migate na somba, wamemeza vigelo kumi na vidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Nao wadile ndia iyo walume wakala kama elufu tano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogenda kuchanha mmazi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-23">Matayo 14:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:15-21">Luka 6:15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Kwaivo Yesu kawalongela waluko wake wengile muingalawa walongole kuita umwambu wa lamba muikae ya Betisaida, kuno yeye kowalaga wanhu weli mumting'hano. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Viyawalagile waja wanhu, kakwela kulugongo kupula. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Vichivikile chilo, ngalawa ija ivika hagati kabisa hadilamba na Yesu kakala yaiyeka kulugongo. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Kawaona waluko wake wogaya kutoa ng'hafi kwa ludabwa, kuno beho kulu dowakimila. Habehi na lukwili, Yesu kawawinza waluko wake, kagenda uchanha ya mazi. Kakala behi na kuwabita, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />ila viwamuone yogenda mmazi, wagesa mzimu, waguta nyangi, <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />kwavija wose wamona wadumba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Bahaja Yesu kawalongela, “Gangamaleni! Iyo nie, seke mdumbe!” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Baho kakwela muingalawa yao na beho dinyamala! Waluko wake wazaganywa ng'hani, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />kwavija wakala hawavimanyile kwa mbuli ya ija migate, mioyo yao ikala midala.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya watamu uko kae ya Genezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matayo 14:34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Viwalokile lamba, wavika Genezaleti, waifunga goya ngalawa yao. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Bahaja viwalawile muingalawa yao, wanhu wammanya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Wanhu wagenda mvijiji vose hima hima, kuno wawapapa watamu wao mmikeka na kuwagala hanhu hohose kuwahulike hayali Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Chila hanhu hayagendile Yesu, ihawa mvijiji na mzikae na mmigunda, wanhu waweka watamu wao hanhu hazelu, wanhu wao wampula yaweng'he nyafasi watamu wamwamhe hata mhinde da valo jake. Na wose wamwamhile, wahonyigwa.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahala kulawa Wahenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matayo 15:1-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Zua dimwe Mafalisayo na wafundaji wamwenga wa ndagizi za Musa wakalile walawa Yelusalemu waiting'hanila wamzunguluka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Wawaona waluko wa Yesu wamwenga woja ndia kwa usisa kwavija hawasunha makono vinogile kama viilondeka mgamahala ga Wayahudi.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Manake Mafalisayo na Wayahudi wose wowinza mahala ga Wayahudi wao hawadaha kuja ndia bila kunawa makono gao vinogile mbaka mching'o kama viilondeka. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Ivija hawadaha kuja chinhu chochose kulawa kudigulilo bila kusunha makono gao kama viilondeka. Na kuna mila zimwenga nyingi ziwawinza Wayahudi kama vija viwasunha vikombe, vimbazi na via va kudila.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Kwaivo waja Mafalisayo na wafunda ndagizi wamuuza Yesu, “Habali waluko wako hawawinza mahala ga wahenga wetu? Badili yake woja bila kusunha makono gao vinogile kama viilondeka?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu kawedika, “Vibilikizi mweye! Isaya mlagusi wa Mulungu kalagusa kweli kwa mbuli yenu viyandike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Wanhu wano wonitogola kwa milomo yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:6">mbali mmoyo mmwao hawakiwinza chiwalonga.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kunifugamila kwao bule tu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">kwavija wofunda mahala ga wanhu tu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 7:7">kama vija mahala ga Mulungu!’<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Mweye mzileka ndagizi za Mulungu na mgoga mahala ga wanhu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu kagendelela kuwalongela, “Mweye mnaubala wa kulema ndagizi za Mulungu ili kuwinza mahala ga wahenga! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Mfano Musa kolonga, ‘Wategeleze Tata na Mami yako,’ na ‘Yoyose yamliga tata hebu mami yake na yakomigwe.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Mbali mweye molonga kama munhu kana chinhu cha kumwing'ha tataake hebu mamiyake mbali yahalonga, chinhu icho ni Kolibani, manake chibaguligwe kama nhosa kwa Mulungu, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />kwaivo muwakimila seke wawataze tata yake hebu mami yake. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ivo mweye mouzeleu Usenga wa Mulungu kwa gaja gamzoele kusang'hana. Mweye mosang'hana mbuli nyingi kwa nzila iyo.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli zimtenda munhu seke yatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matayo 15:10-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu kadikema kaidi dija bumbila da wanhu na kawalongela, “Nhegelezeni, kila munhu yaimanye mbuli ino. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Habule kinhu chimwingila munhu chimtenda sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu, mbali chija chimlawa icho chimtenda sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Munhu yeli na magutwi yahulike na kuimanya mbuli ino.”<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Yesu viyadilekile dija bumbila da wanhu na kwingila mng'anda, waluko wake Yesu wamuuza mbuli ya uja mfano. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yesu kawedika, “Hata namweye hamvimanya? Hamvimanyile kua chinhu chilikunze chihamwingila munhu hachimtenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Munhu yahaja chinhu hakingila mmoyo mwake mbali mmunda na amala cholavigwa mmunda mwake kuita kuicholo.” Kwakulonga ivo, Yesu kaving'ha uhalali vyakuja vose kua vinoga kujigwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Chija chimlawa munhu mmoyo icho chimtenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Kalonga ivo manake muumoyo wa munhu molawa, kutonga vihile, na luhadu, ubavi na ukomaji, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />na ugoni na maya ya vinhu na ubananzi na uvwizi na uloho wa vinhu na migongo na maligo na udulu na ubozi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Ubananzi uno wose wolawa mgati mwa munhu nawo womtenda munhu sekeyatogoligwe kumfugamila Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tumanilo da muke imwe heli Myahudi.</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matayo 15:21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Baho Yesu kasegela uko na kaita mzikae zili habehi na kae ya Tilo. Kengila muing'anda imwe, nayo halondile wanhu wavimanye kengila umo mbali hadahile kuifisa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Mbali muke imwe yeli na mwana yambule chinyamkela, kahulika mbuli ziyatenda Yesu, na viyahulike Yesu ka haja keza na kumtumbalila mavindi Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Kampula Yesu yamlave mwanage chinyamkela. Muke iyo hawile Myahudi, mbali kaleligwa uko Foinike isi ya Silia. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yesu kamlongela, “Tebu walekeni tanhu wana wegute, kwavija havinogile kusola ndia ya wana na kuwapigisila umbwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mbali muke ija kamwidika, “Mndewa chuulonga kweli, hata umbwa woja ndia ilagazigwa muimeza na wana.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Baho Yesu kamlongela, “Kwa ivo vuwidikile, genda ukae yako, na chinyamkela kamlekesa biti yako.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Kabwela ukae yake na kamvika biti yake katambalala mdikomwa, na chinyamkela kamala kumlekesa.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamhonya munhu yakalile msuamagutwi na bubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Amala Yesu kahalawa muikae ya Tilo kabita hagati ha Sidoni mbaka lamba da Galilaya, na kwingila Dekapoli manake kae kumi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Uko, wanhu wamgalila Yesu munhu msuamagutwi, iyo ivija kakala na bubu, wampula yamwikile makono gake mditwi munhu iyo ili yamhonye. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Amala Yesu kamsegeza ija msuamagutwi hamgwazo hatali na wanhu, Yesu kagela vidole vake mmagutwi ga ija munhu. Amala kaitemela mate mmakono gake na kwamha lulimi lwa ija munhu kwa chidole. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Baho Yesu kalola kuulanga kwa Mulungu, kakwega muhe kwa ubazi na kamlongela,“Efata,” maanake, “Vubuka.”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Bahaja magutwi gavubuka na lulimi lwake lulekesigwa na kasonga kulonga. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu kawalagiza seke wamlongele munhu yoyose mbuli izo. Mbali kila viyawagoma seke walonge, wao wokongeza kulonga chila hanhu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Wanhu wakanganya ng'hani, walonga, “Katenda mbuli zose vinogile ng'hani! Kowadahiza mswamagutwi kuhulika na weli na ludanha kulonga!”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu koweng'ha ndia wanhu elufu nne</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matayo 15:32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mchipindi icho, bumbila kulu da wanhu diiting'hanila kaidi. Kwavija wakala wabule ndia, Yesu kawakema waluko wake kawalongela, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Nodionela bazi bumbila dino da wanhu, kwavija chikalahamwe zua da kadatu sambi na wabule ndia. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nihawalongelaga waite ukae na nzala, wosinduka nzila kwavija wamwenga wolawa kutali.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Waluko wake wamulongela, “Mbali hano chahachiwala chopatahi migate ya kwenela kuwalisa wanhu wose? <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu kawauza, “Mna migate mingahi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Wamwidika, “China migate saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Yesu kawalongela wanhu wakale hasi. Viyamalile kusola migate na kumwing'ha hewela Mulungu, kaibanzula na kuweng'ha waluko wake ili wawagolele wanhu, waluko wake watenda ivo. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Ivija wakala na visomba vidodo, Yesu kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu, kawalagiza waluko wake waweng'he wanhu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Waja wanhu wose waija ndia iyo mbaka weguta, amala waluko wa Yesu wakunzanya vihande visigale wamemeza vigelo saba. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Wanhu wajile ndia ija wovika elufu nne. Viyakomeleze Yesu kawalaga wanhu waite kumwao, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />na bahaja kengila muingalawa yeli na waluko wake waita ubanzi wa Dalumanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wolonda chilaguso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matayo 16:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Mafalisayo weza, wasonga kumuuza Yesu. Ili kumgeza, wampula yawalagusile chilakuso kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu kalumila ng'hani mmoyo, kawauza, “Habali ulelo uno wolonda vilaguso? Kweli, nowalongela, hawalagusiligwa vilaguso vovose.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Amala Yesu kawaleka Mafalisayo, kakwela muingalawa na waluko wake, kasonga kuloka umwambu.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itiganyeni na mela da Mafalisayo na ya Helode</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matayo 16:5-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Waluko wakala waisemwa kugala migate ya kwenela, wakala na mgate umwe tu muingalawa. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu kawakomhokela, waitiganye na mela da Mafalisayo na wa Helode.<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Waluko wa Yesu wasonga kuilongela wenyego kua, “Kalonga vino kwavija hachigalile migate.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu kavimanya viwotonga, kawauza, “Mbona molongelela kwambuli ya kukosa migate? Mng'hali hamvimanya hebu kupata ubala? Ivo, mbona mna miyoyo midala? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mna meso mbali hakulola, mna magutwi mbali hamhulika? Ivo, muisemwa <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />viniibanzule ija migate mitano kuwalisa wanhu elufu tano? Mkuzanya vigelo vingahi vimemile ndia isigazigwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Wamwidikila kua “Vigelo kumi na vidi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Ivo, viniibanzule ija migate saba kuwalisa wanhu elufu nne, mkuzanya vigelo vingahi vimemile ndia isigazigwe?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Wamwidikila, “Vigelo saba.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Amala kawauza, “Ivo, mng'hali hamnavimanya?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamhonya chipofu uko Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Yesu na waluko wavika kae ya Betisaida na wanhu wamgalila munhu imwe chipofu, wampula yamwamhe munhu iyo ili yamhonye. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu kamwamha mkono iyo munhu chipofu na kamgala hamwande chidogo haikae iyo. Viyamtemele mate mmeso na kumwikila makono, Yesu kamuuza, “Koona chochose?”<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Chipofu ija kalola, na kalonga, “Nowaona wanhu, wooneka kama mibiki igenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu kamwikila kaidi makono mmeso. Amala meso gake gahona, kabwelela kulola na kakiona chila chinhu ivija vichili. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu kamlaga yabwele ukae yake, kuno kamlalika, “Genda ukae yako seke ubitile hagati ya kae.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo komtogola Yesu kua iyo Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matayo 16:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu na waluko wake wasegela kuita mvijiji vili habehi na uko Kaisalia Filipi. Viwakalile nzila Yesu kawauza, “Wanhu wolonga nie nani?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Wamwidika, “Wamwenga wolonga gweye Yohana Mbatizi, wamwenga wolonga kwa mlagusi wa Mulungu Elia na wamwenga wolonga gweye imwe kati ya waja walagusi wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yesu kawauza, “Ivo, na mweye, molonga nie nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Petulo kamwidika, “Gweye iyo Kilisito.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu kawagoma seke wamlongele munhu yoyose kua nie iyo Kilisito.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolongelela madununzo na ifa yake na kuzilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matayo 16:21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesu kasonga kuwafunda waluko wake kua nie Mwana wa Munhu nolondeka nidununzike ng'hani na kulemigwa na wavele vilongozi, wakulu wa walava nhambiko, na wafunda ndagizi za Musa, na womkoma na mdizua da kadatu kozilibuka. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Kagalonga gano bila kifiso, lekaivo Petulo kamsola hamgwazo kasonga kumgoma. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Mbali Yesu kahinduka na kuwalola waluko wake, kamlongela Petulo, “Bwela hachisogo, Mwenembago gweye! Gweye hutonga gali kwa Mulungu mbali kotonga ga wanhu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Amala kadikema bumbila dija da wanhu na waluko wake, kalonga, “Munhu yoyose yolonda kua mjalusona wangu, kolondeka yazileke mbuli zake mwenyego na yatogole kudununzika mbaka kudanganika kwa mbuli yangu, leka yaniwinze. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kwavija munhu yoyose yolonda kuuhonya ugima wake mwenyego kowagiza, mbali yoyose yolonda kuwagiza ugima wake mwenyego kwa mbuli yangu na kwa mbuli ya Usenga Unogile, iyo kouhonya. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Yomfaya choni munhu kama yahapata isi yose na kuwagiza ugima wake mwenyego? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Hebu munhu kolava choni yapate kaidi ugima wake? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Munhu yoyose muulelo uno uli na ugoni na malozo, yahanionela chinyala nie na usenga wangu, nie Mwana wa Munhu, nayo nomlema yaheza mdibung'hulo da Tata yangu hamwe na watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu kagendelela kuwalongela, “Nowalongela ukweli, kuna wanhu wamwenga welihano hawadanganika mbaka weze kuuona Ufaume wa Mulungu uheza na udaho.”<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kooneka Muukulu wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matayo 17:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Mazua sita hamwande, Yesu kawasola Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana kawagala hachanha ya lugongo lutali weli waiyeka. Uko Yesu kageluka chihanga chake kuno wolola. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Valo jake dibung'huka dikala zelu chuwee mbaka dobalika, uzelu uja munhu yoyose muiisi hadaha kusunha ivo. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Bahaja waja waluko wadatu wawaona walagusi wa Musa na Elia wakala wolonga na Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petulo kamlongela Yesu, “Mfundaji, vinoga cheye kukala hano. Chitogolele chizenge viheha vidatu, chimwe chako, chimwe cha Musa na chimwenga cha Elia.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petulo kalonga ivo kwavija yeye na wayage wakala wodumba ng'hani na hamanyile cha kulonga.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Amala dilawila wingu, diwagubika, nayo dizi kulawa kwa Mulungu ihulilkika ilonga, “Ino iyo Mwanangu, nili na wende nayo, mtegelezeni.” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Bahaja viwalolile kuno na kuno, wamuona Yesu tu hawamonile munhu imwenga yoyose yelinayo.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Viwakalile wohulumuka kulawa kulugongo, Yesu kawagoma “Sekewamlongele munhu yoyose gaja gawaonile, mbaka nie Mwana wa Munhu niheza kuzilibuka.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Nao wasang'hana kama viyalongile, mbali wakala woiuza wenyego, “Kuno kuzilibuka manake choni?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Wamuuza Yesu walonga, “Habali wafunda ndagizi za Musa wolonga kua yolondeka Elia tebu yabwele kabula ya Yesu?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu kawedika, “Ivoili, mosi Elia kokwiza, ili kuzikagoya mbuli zose. Hataivo habali mbuli ino yandikigwa kua Mwana wa Munhu kolondeka adununzigwe ng'hani na kuzehigwa? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Mbali nomlongeleni, Elia kamala kwiza mwaka nawo wamtendela viwalondile, kama viyandikigwe kwa mbuli yake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Elia viyamalile kwiza Yesu kawalinga Yohana Mbatizi na Elia. Yohana Mbatizi kasang'hana sang'hano ija Wayahudi wavimanya kua Elia yahaitendile. Sang'hano ijo dikala kumtandila Yesu nzila</char></note><verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamhonya Mbwanga yambule chinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matayo 17:14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Yesu na waja waluko wadatu viwabwelile kwa wayao, wawavika wazungukiligwa na bumbila da wanhu na wafunda ndagizi za Musa wamwenga wakala woibishila na waluko wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Bahaja wanhu waja viwamonile Yesu, wakanganya ng'hani, wamkimbilila ili wamlamse. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu kawauza waluko wake, “Moibishila choni nawo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Baho munhu imwe kulawa mdibumbila ijo kamwidika Yesu, “Mfundaji, nimgala mwanangu kumwako, kana kinyamkela yomtenda yawe bubu. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mala zose yahamwingila, komgwisa hasi na komtenda yalawe mahovu mmulomo, kuno koluma meno na komtenda yakakamale lukuli lose. Niwapula waluko wako wamlave chinyamkela iyo mbali hawadahile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye ulelo ulibule tumanilo! Nokala na mweye mbaka lini? Nowafunyila moyo mbaka lini? Haya ngalileni hano mwana iyo.” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Nawo wamgala mbwanga ija kwa Yesu. Bahaja Chinyamkela viyamonile Yesu, kamgela utamu wa kugwa mbwanga ija, kagwa hasi, kabimbilika kuno mahovu golawa mmulomo. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu kamuuza tata wa mawana ija, “Mwanago kasonga lini kulawililigwa na utamu uno?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Nayo tata wa mwana ija kamwidika, “Tangia haudodo wake. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mala zimwenga chinyamkela komgwisa mwana muumoto, hebu mmazi ili yamkome. Mbali kama kodaha kutenda jojose, chokupula chionele bazi uchitaze!”<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu kamlongela, “Seke ulonge kama uhadaha! Gose godahika kwaija yomtogola Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Bahaja tata yake mwana ija kaguta nyangi kalonga, “Nhogola. Nhaze kuleka kutogola kwangu!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Yesu viyaonile bumbila da wanhu woiting'hanila kwa wingi hamwake, kamkomhokela ija chinyamkela, kamlongela, “Gweye chinyamkela yuutenda mbwanga ino kua bubu na uswamagutwi, nokulongela umlekese mbwanga ino na seke umbwelele kaidi!”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Chinyamkela ija kaguta nyangi, kamgela utamu wa kugwa kwa ludabwa na kamlawa. Ija mbwanga kakala kama mtufi, ivo wanhu wengi walonga, “Kadanganika.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Mbali Yesu kamgoga mkono mbwanga ija kamwinula, nayo kenuka.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Yesu viyengile mng'anda, waluko wake wamuuza weli waiyeka, “Mbona cheye hachidahile kumlava kinyamkela ija?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu kawalongela, “Chinyamkela wa namna ino hadahika kulawa ivija, ila tanhu kwa kumpula Mulungu tu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolongelela kaidi mbuli ya ifa na kuzilibuka kwake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Matayo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yesu na waluko wake wasegela uko, wabitila Galilaya. Yesu halondile munhu yoyose avimanye hanhu haweli, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />kwavija kakala kowafunda waluko wake. Kawalongela, “Mwana wa munhu kohindukigwa na kugeligwa mmakono ga wanhu nao womkoma, nayo mdizua da kadatu tangia viyakomigwe kozilibuka.<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Mbali waluko wake hawakimanyile kija chiyalonga, nao wadumba kumuuza.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelihi yeli Mlongozi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matayo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Ivo Yesu na waluko wake wavika Kapelinaumu na viwengile mng'anda kawauza, “Mkala moibishila choni kuja nzila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Mbali hawamwidike, kwavija mnzila wakala hawaitogolele kwambuli ya yelihi mlongozi mmwao kubita wose. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu kalala hasi, kawakema waluko wake wose kumi na waidi kawalongela, “Kama munhu yoyose yahalonda kua mlongozi kolondeka kua mdodo na yawasang'hanile wanhu wose.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Amala kamsola mwana mdodo kamwimiza hagati yao, kamhagatila, labaho kawalongela, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Munhu yoyose yonda yambokele mwana imwe mwa wana wano wadodo, kwa mbuli yangu kambokela nie. Nayo yambokele nie hanibokele nie tu mbali kambokela na Mulungu yanhumile.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ija hachilemile kailumba na cheye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka 9:49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Ohana kamlongela, “Mfundaji, chimuona munhu kolava chinyamkela kwa zina jako na cheye chimgoma kwavija iyo hali na cheye.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Seke mumgome chija chiyasang'hana munhu iyo. Habule munhu yotenda miuzonza kwa zina jangu amala hamwande chidogo yeze kunilonga vihile. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Munhu yoyose yolonga ganogile getu iyo koilumba na cheye. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Nomlongeleni kweli, yoyose yamwing'hani mweye chikombe cha mazi kwa Zina jangu kwavija mweye mwa wanhu wa Kilisito, kweli haihonya mbee nhunza yake.”<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vinhu vimuhonza munhu kutenda malozo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matayo 18:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Munhu yoyose yonda yamhonze imwe mwa wana wadodo wano wonitogola koloza, vinoga kumwake munhu iyo afungiligwe dibwe kulu da kusagila na yatumbukizigwa mwibahali. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Kama mkono wako uhakuhonza uloze, udumule. Vinoga ng'hani kumwako kwingila muugima ulibule uhelelo uli na mkono umwe badili ya kua na makono maidi amala kokwingila mchitala cha wafile hanhu hali na moto uja haufa. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Umo kuli na funza hawofa hebu moto ukwaka bila kufa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:44</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mayandiko gamwenga ga umwaka gabule misitali ino</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Kama mgulu wako uhakuhonza uloze, udumule. Vinoga ng'hani kwingila muugima ulibule uhehelo uli mbete mbete badili ya kua na magulu maidi amala kokwingila mchitala cha wafile kuja kuli na moto ukwaka haufa. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Umo kuli na funza hawofa hebu moto ukwaka bila kufa. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Najo ziso jako dihakuhonza uloze, ding'ole. Vinoga ng'hani uwe na gele mbali wingile muugima badili uwe na meso maidi amala wasigwe mchitala cha wafile, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />hanhu baho ‘funza wake hawofa hebu moto ukwaka haufa.’<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Mulungu kombitiza Chila munhu mgamadununzo goilinga na kulukuzigwa na moto, kama vija wanhu viwobakaza munyu muinyama kabula ya nhosa ya kulunguza.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />“Munyu unoga, mbali ihazabuka yoigela choni ili ikolele kaidi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Molondeka muilumbe mweye kwa mweye kama munyu viikolela, mkale kwa utindiwala, chila munhu na miage.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kofunza mbuli ya nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matayo 19:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Amala Yesu kahalawa uko Kapelinaumu kaloka lwanda lwa Yolodani, kaita ubanzi wa Yudea. Bumbila kulu da wanhu dimwizila kaidi na kawafunda kama vigali mazoela gake.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Mafalisayo wamwenga wamuwinza Yesu ili wamgeze kwa kumuuza, “Ivo, habule mbuli munhu yahamwasa mwehe wake?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu kawedika, “Ivo, Musa kawalagiza choni?” <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Nawo wamwidika, “Musa kaching'ha hiali kua mulume kodaha kumwandikila balua ya nyasa mwehe wake.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu kawalongela, Musa kawandikila ndagizi iyo kwavija hamgoga mahala. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Mbali tangia haumwanduso wa kulumbigwa isi, “Mulungu kawalumba mulume na muke. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Nao wokua lukuli lumwe, mulume komleka tata yake na mami yake na Mulungu kowalumba wao waidi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Nao waidi wokua lukuli lumwe na sio waidi kaidi. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Ivo, chiyalumbile Mulungu, munhu seke yachigole.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Yesu viyengile mng'anda kaidi, waluko wake wamuuza kwa mbuli iyo ya nyasa. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Kawedika, “Mulume yoyose yomwasa mwehe wake na kusola mwehe imwenga, komtendela ugoni mwehe wake. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Ivija nayo muke yomwasa mulume wake koita kusoligwa na mulume imwenga, kotemtendela ugoni mulume wake.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapulila ganogile wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matayo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:13-15">Luka 19:13-15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Wanhu wakala womgalila Yesu wana wadodo ili yawekile makono mditwi na kuwapulila Mulungu yaweng'he ganogile mbali waluko wake wawakomokela. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yesu viyaonile gago gatendeka kagevuzika, kawalongela waluko wake, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu, kaidi seke muwakimile, manake Ufaume wa Mulungu ni wa wanhu kama wana wano. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nomlongeleni kweli, munhu yoyose kama yahalema kubokela Ufaume wa Mulungu kama mwana mdodo, hengila umo mbee.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Kawasola wana mmakono gake, kawahagatila, kawekila magono gake mditwi, na kawapulila Mulungu yaweng'he ganogile.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu mzenzi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matayo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Yesu viyakalile yosegela, munhu imwe kamkimbilila, katumbala mavindi hamwake, kamuuza, “Mfundaji ulibule gehile, nhende choni mhate ugima ulibule uhelelo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu kamuuza, “Mbona kung'hema nilibule gehile? Habule yelibule gehile ila Mulungu yaiyeka. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Yesu kamlongela, kozimanya ndagizi za Mulungu, ‘Seke ukome, seke utende ugoni, seke wibe, seke ulonge uvwizi, seke uvwize, wategeleze tata yako na mami yako.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Kamwidika, “Mfundaji, ndagizi zino zose nizimanya tangia udodo wangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu kamlola na kamwonela wende, kamlongela, “Kuhungukiligwa na chinhu chimwe, genda ukagule vinhu vako vose na sente uweng'he vikumbi muyega, nagweye kokua na uzenzi wako kuulanga kwa Mulungu, amala wize uniwinze.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Munhu ija viyahulike ivo, kalumila ng'hani mmoyo kasegela yeli na giogio kwavija kakala na vinhu vingi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu kalola kuno na kuno, kawalongela waluko wake, “Yokua vidala ng'hani wanhu kwingila mu Ufaume wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Waluko wake wakanganyika ng'hani kwa mbuli iyo. Mbali Yesu kabwelela kaidi, kawalongela, “Wanangu, loleni viili ndala kwa ija yotumainila vinhu vake kwingila mu Ufaume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Vibuha ng'hani kwa mnyama Ngamia kubita mdizonzo da shindano badili ya munhu mzenzi kwingila mu Ufaume wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Waluko wake wakanganyika ng'hani. Waiuza wenyego, “Ivo yelihi yodaha kuhonyingwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu kawalola, kawalongela, “Kwa wanhu dino hadidahika, mbali kwa Mulungu sio ivo. Gose kwa Mulungu godahika.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petulo kasonga kumulongela, “Chileka chila chinhu chikuwinza gweye!”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu kalonga, “Nowalongela kweli, habule munhu yoyose alekile ng'anda yake, ndugu wakilume, hebu wachike, tata na mami yake, wana hebu migunda kwa mbuli yangu na kwa Usenga Unogile, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />honda yalihigwe bwelele muiisi ino. Kobokela ng'anda na ndugu wachilume na ndugu wa chike, tata na mami yake na wana na migunda na madununzo. Amala kobokela ugima ulibule uhelelo muiisi ikwiza. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Mbali wengi walongole wokua hachikomelezo, na wachikomelezo wokua haulongozi.<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kalongelela ifa yake na kuzilibuka mala ya kadatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matayo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Yesu na waluko wake viwakalile nzila woita Kae ya Yelusalemu, Yesu kakala yawalongolele. Waluko wake wakala wokanganya, na waja wanhu wakalile wowawinza wamema gudemo. Yesu kawasola kaidi hamgwazo waja wakuko wake kumi na waidi na kuwalongela gonda gampate. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Kalonga, “Tegelezeni choita Yelusalemu, na uko nie Mwana wa munhu nogogigwa na kugaligwa kwa walongozi wa walava nhambiko na wofunza ndagizi za Musa. Wao wonilamula ifa na kunigela mmakono ga wanhu hawali Wayahudi. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Nao wonizeha na kunitemela mate, wonilibula mbalati na kunikoma. Na zua da kadatu nozilibuka.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakobo na Yohana wopula Yesu ukulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matayo 20:20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Amala Yakobo na Yohana, wanage Zebedayo, weza haulongozi hayakalile Yesu na kumulongela, “Mfundaji, chonda uchitendele chonda chikupule.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Nayo kawauza, “Ivo, molonda niwatendele choni?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Wamwidika, “Wahakala muukulu wako, chonda chikale hamwe imwe yakale ubanzi wako wa kulume na imwenga ubanzi wako wa kumoso.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Hamdimanyile dimpula. Ivo, modaha kung'wila chikombe cha madununzo chonda ning'wela nie, hebu kubatizigwa ubatizo wa madununzo wonda nibatizigwe nie?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Wamwidika, “Chodaha.” Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Chikombe niking'wela na mweye moking'wela na ubatizo umbatizigwa na mweye mobatizigwa, <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />mbali kukala ubanzi wangu wakulume hebu wakumoso sio mbuli yangu nie kuweng'ha. Mulungu koweng'ha nyafasi izo waja yawasagule.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Waja waluko wamwenga kumi wasigale viwahulike mbuli iyo wawagevukila Yakobo na Yohana. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu kawakema hamwe waluko wake na kawalongela, “Mvimanya kua walongozi wa wanhu waja hawali Wayahudi wolongoza wanhu kwa ludabwa, na ivija mvimanya kua weli na ukulu wotumila ludabwa lwao ili wanhu wawategeleze. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Mbali sio kumwenu. Badili yake yoyose yondakua mkulu kumwenu kolondeka yawe msang'hani wenu <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />na yoyose yondakua mlongozi, kolondeka yawasang'hanile mweye wose. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Hata nie Mwana wa munhu sizile kusang'haniligwa, ila kusang'hana na kulava ugima wangu kuwa loholo da wanhu wengi.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komhonya Batimayo chipofu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matayo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Amala Yesu na waluko wake wavika muikae ya Yeliko. Na viwakalile wolawa umo hamwe na bumbila kulu da wanhu, chipofu imwe zina jake Batimayo, mwanage Timayo, kakala yakalile hamgwazo nzila yopula wanhu wamwing'he vinhu. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Viyahulike kua Yesu kulawa kae ya Nazaleti kobita baho, kasonga kwinula dizi jake kakema, “Go Yesu, Mwana wa Daudi, unionele bazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Wanhu wengi wamkomhokela, wamlongela yanyamale hupi, mbali yeye kakongeza kuguta kuno kolonga, “Go Mwana wa Daudi, nionele bazi!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu kema na kalonga, “Mkemeni yeze.” Ivo wamkema ija chipofu kuno womlongela, “Gangamala! Ima, Yesu kokukema.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Nayo kenuka na kajasa golole jake kazumha, kamuwinza Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu kamuuza, “Konda nikutendele choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">“Chipofu ija kamwidika, “Mfundaji, nokupula nie nolonda kulola.”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Yesu kamlongela, “Haya genda, kutumanila kwako kukuhonya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Bahaja kasonga kulola, kamuwinza Yesu nzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalem kwa ndeng'helelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Viwawile behi na Yelusalemu, wavika mvijiji va Betifage na Betania kuulugongo lwa Mizeituni, Yesu kawalagiza waluko wake waidi, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />na kawalongela, “Gendeni mbaka mchijiji chili haulongozi yenu na mhengila tu mchijiji, momvika mwana mhunda kafungigwa, habule munhu yoyose yampapile. Mfunguleni, mngalile hano. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Kama munhu yoyose yonda yawauze, ‘Habali momfungula?’ Mlongeleni, ‘Mndewa komlonda na kombweleza hano vino sambi.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Wagenda, wamvika mwana mhunda kafungigwa mumgwazo mwa nzila, habehi na lwivi lwa ng'anda. Viwakalile womfungula, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />wanhu wamwenga wakalile wema habehi wawauza, mwehe motenda choni baho? “Habali momfungula mwana mhunda iyo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Waja waluko wawedika kama vija Yesu viyawalagize, nawaja wanhu wawaleka wamsole. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Amala wamgala ija mwana mhunda kwa Yesu na kumwikila vivalo vao mumgongo, nayo Yesu kakwela uchanha yake. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Wanhu wengi wayanzanza vivalo vao mnzila na wamwenga wayanzanza makwamvi gawakanhile mmigunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Amala wanhu wose waja wakalile walongole haulongozi na waja wakalile wokwiza hachisogo wenula dizi, walonga, “Mulungu yatogoligwe! Kamweda ija yokwiza kwa zina da Mndewa! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />“Umweda Ufaume ukwiza wa Tata yetu Daudi!” “Mulungu yeli kuchanha yatogoligwe ng'hani!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu kengila Yelusalemu na kuita hai ng'anda ya Mulungu. Nakalola chila chinhu chiliumo. Mbali kwavija ikala chigulogulo, kaita mchijiji cha Betania yeli hamwe na waja waluko kumi na waidi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kawinukila mbiki ukemigwa mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Matayo 21:18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Igolo yake viwakalile wosegela mchijiji cha Betania kuita Yelusalem, Yesu kaona nzala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Yesu kauona mtini kwa kutali, kaita yalole kama una manhunda. Viyauvikile, kauvika una mayani muhala, kwavija hauwile msimo wa manhunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesu kawinukila kaulongela mtini, “Tangia sambi hulela manhunda mbee.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Na waluko wake wamuhulika viyalongile ivo.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koita hai ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matayo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Viwavikile Yelusalemu, Yesu kengila halubuga lwa ng'anda ya Mulungu na kusonga kuwawinga waja wakala wogula vinhu va wayao na kugulila ivao umo mng'anda. Kazihindula meza za waja wakalile wovunja sente na vigoda va waja wakalile wogula hua, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />hebu hamwing'ile munhu yoyose nyafasi ya kusola chinhu muja haluhelengo lwa ng'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Nayo viyakalile yowafunda, Mulungu kalonga,” Hayandikigwe kua, ‘Ng'anda yangu yokua ng'anda ya kufugamila Mulungu kwa wanhu wa isi zose?’ Mbali mweye muitenda kua mhango ya wabavi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Vilongozi wa walava nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi za Musa wahulika mbuli izo, nao watanda ubala wa kumkoma. Mbali wamdumba, kwavija wanhu wengi wakala wokanganyika kwa gaja gayokala yowafunda.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Hadiswele zua, Yesu na waja waluko wake wahalawa muikae ija.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hala kulawa mbiki wa Mtini unyalile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matayo 21:20-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Imitondo yake, viwakalile wobita mnzila, wauona uja mbiki wamtini unyala wose mbaka mmazizi gake. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petulo kakumbuka na kamlongela Yesu, “Mfundaji, ulole! Uja mtini uwinukile unyala!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu kawedika kawalongela, “Mtogoleni Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nomlongeleni ukweli, munhu yoyose yonda yaulongele lugongo luno, ‘Somoka ukasigwe mwibahali,’ na seke yagele shaka mmoyo, mbali yatogole tu kua gago gayalongile golawila, Mulungu komtendela ivo. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Kwaivo nowalongeleni, gogose gampula na mhamfugamila Mulungu, tumanileni kua mgabokela nago gawa genu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Namweye mwahampula Mulungu, munhu yahawa na mbuli na miage yemlekese mmoyo nayo Tata yeli kuulanga yamlekeseleni na mweye malozo genu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Mbali kama mweye hamwalekesela wayenu ubananzi wao, na Tata yenu yeli kuulanga hawalekesela na mweye malozo genu.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">26 Mayandiko gamwenga gaumwaka gabule msitali uno</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wouza udaho wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matayo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yesu na waluko wake wavika kaidi muikae ya Yelusalemu. Yesu viyakalile yogenda hai ng'anda ya Mulungu, walongozi wa walava nhambiko, na wafunda ndagizi za Musa na wavele vilongozi wamwizila hamwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Wamuuza, “Chilongele kosang'hana mbuli zino kwa udaho gani? Na yelihi yakudahize kusang'hana mbuli zino?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu kawedika, “Namweye nowauza mbuli imwe. Mhanidika, nanie nowalongela nosang'hana mbuli zino kwa udaho gani. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Nongeleni, udaho wa Yohana kubatiza ulawa kwa Mulungu hebu kwa wanhu?”<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Wailongela wenyego kwa wenyego, amala walonga, “Kama chihalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa Mulungu, kochiuza, ‘Habali hamumtogole?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Mbali chahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wanhu,’ wanhu wogevuzika.” Wawadumba wanhu, manake chila munhu kavimanya Yohana kakala kweli Mlagusi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Kwaivo wamlongela Yesu, “Hachimanyile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Nayo Yesu kawalongela, “Nanie ivija siwalongela nosang'hana mbuli zino kwa udaho gani.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Mfano wa Vilongozi Wayahudi na walimi wakomaji</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matayo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yesu kasonga kulonga nao kwa mifano, kawalongela, “Munhu imwe kahanda mizabibu mumgunda wake. Kazenga lwigo kuzunguluka mgunda, mgati kahimba hanhu hakukamila zabibu, kezenga lingo da kwamilila. Kakodisha mgunda wake kwa walimi, amala kagoga mwanza kuita isi imwenga. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mulao vuuvikile, mwenye mgunda kagala mtumwa wake kwa wao walimi ili wamgolele fungu jake da zabibu mwa izo ziwahulule mumgunda. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Mbali waja walimi wamwamha ija mtumwa na wamtoa na wamuwinga kabwela bule. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Amala ija mwenye mgunda kalagiza mtumwa wake imwenga kumwao, waja walimi wamtoa mditwi iyo nayo na kumtendela mbuli za chinyala. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Amala kalagiza mtumwa imwenga, ino wamkoma. Kalagiza watumwa wamwenga wengi, wamwenga watoigwa na waja walimi na wamwenga wawakoma. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mwenye mgunda kasigala na munhu imwe tu, iyo mwanage yaiyeka yeli na wende nayo. Amala kamlagiza kalonga, ‘Kwiza womtegeleza kwavija mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Mbali waja walimi viwamonile yokwiza wailongela wenyego, ‘Ino iyo muhazi wa mgunda uno, izoni chimkome, na mgunda uno wokua uhazi wetu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ivo wamwamha, wamkoma na kuwasa mtufi wake kunze mwa mgunda wa zabibu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Baho Yesu kawauza, “Ivo movimanya ija mwenye mgunda kowatenda choni wao walimi? Kokwiza kuwakoma wao walimi, amala koweng'ha wamwenga mgunda uo wa zabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Mweye hamsomile mayandiko ga Mulungu?”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">‘Dibwe dija dilemigwe na wazengaji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:10">dihinduka kua dibwe kulu da kutumanila kubita mabwe gose ga kuzengela.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Dino ijo diyatendile Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:11">najo dauzonza mmeso getu!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Viwavimanyile mfano uja uwaloza wao Mafalisayo, Wakulu wa nhambiko na wafunda ndagizi za Musa walonda kumgoga, mbali wadumba bumbila da wangu wamemile. Ivo wamleka na wahalawa.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuliha kodi kwa Kaisali</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matayo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Amala walongozi wa Wayahudi wawalagiza Mafalisayo wamwenga na wajalusona wa Helode ili weze kumgeza Yesu kwagaja gayalonga. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Wamwizila, wamlongela, “Mfundaji, chivimanya gweye munhu yalibule dihile na kolonga kweli. Gweye hugazigwa na wanhu, kwavija hugesa kua wao china nani. Mbali gweye kofunda Usenga wa Mulungu vija viilondeka na kweli. Ivo, yofaya kumliha Kaisali kodi hebu haifaya?<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Mbali Yesu kavimanya ng'hani ubilikizi wao. Yesu kawauza, “Habali mogeza kunhega? Ngalileni iyo sente niilole.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Wamgalila iyo sente. Nayo kawauza wajalusona wa Helode, “Chihanga chino na zina dino danani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">Wamwidika, “Va Kaisali.”<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Baho Yesu kawalongela, “Mwing'heni Kaisali galigake, na ga Mulungu mwing'heni Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Nao wakanganyika ng'hani kwa gaja gayalongile Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofunda mbuli ya kuzilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matayo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Amala Masadukayo, waja wolonga kua habule kuzilibuka wamwizila Yesu, <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />wamuuza, “Mfundaji, Musa kachandikila kua kama munhu yahadanganika na kumleka mwehe wake kabule mwana, baho ndugu yake komsola ija mgane ili yamlelele wana ndugu yake ija yadanganike. <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Hakala na ndugu saba. Mwanamkulu kasola na kadanganika bila kulela mwana yoyose. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ndugu yake wa kaidi nayo kamsola ija mgane, mbali nayo kadanganika bila kuleka mwana yoyose. Ikala ivo na kwa ndugu wa kadatu. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Igendelela ivo kwa waja wose ndugu saba habule yalekile mwana. Hachikomelezo ija mgane nayo kadanganika. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Muuzilibuko, iyo kokua mwehe wa yelihi kwavija kakala yasoligwe na ndugu wose saba?”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mokwaga kwavija hammanyile mayandiko ga Mulungu hebu udaho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Wafile wahazilibuka, hawasola hebu kusoligwa, wokua kama watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Kwambuli ya kuzilibuka, Ivo, hamsomile mchitabu cha Musa vija Mulungu viyalongile na Musa kulawa mdibwilingu dija dikwaka moto kalonga, ‘Nie, iyo Mulungu wa Abulamu na Mulungu wa Isaka na Mulungu wa Yakobo.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yesu kagendelela kulonga, “Mulungu hali Mulungu wa wafile, mbali ni Mulungu wa wagima. Kwaivo mwaga ng'hani.”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndagizi iling'hulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matayo 22:34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mfundaji imwe wa ndagizi za Musa keza kawategeleza viwailongela. Kaona vija Yesu viyalongila vinogile, nayo kamuuza Yesu, “Mzindagizi zose, ilihi ing'hulu kubita zose?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu kawedika, “Ndagizi ng'huliu iyo ino, ‘Tegelezeni mweye wanhu wa Izilaeli, Mndewa Mulungu wetu, Mndewa iyo imwe tu. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Mwing'he wende Mndewa Mulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose, na kwa muhe wako wose na kwa nzewele zako zose na kwa ludabwa lwako lwose.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Yakaidi iyo ino: ‘Mwing'he wende miago kama vuigesa mwenyego.’ Habule ndagizi imwenga ili ng'hulu kubita zino.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ija mfundaji wa ndagizi za Musa kamuuza Yesu, “Mfundaji, kulonga goya kua Mulungu ni imwe na habule imwenga ila iyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Kumwing'ha wende Mulungu kwa moyo wose na kwa nzewele zose na kwa ludabwa wose na kumwing'ha wende miago kama vuiing'ha wende mwenyego mbuli iyo inoga ng'hani kubita kumlavila Mulungu nhosa na nhambiko.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu viyaonile kamwidikila goya, kamlongela, “Gweye huli hatali kwingila Ufaume wa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Kulawa baho, habule munhu yoyose yagezile kumuuza kaidi mbuli Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelihi Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matayo 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Chipindi Yesu viyakalile yofunda hai ng'anda ya Mulungu, kawauza, “Yokuwaze wafunda ndagizi za Musa wolonga kua Kilisito Mwanage Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Kuno Daudi mwenyego kwakulongozigwa na Muhe wa Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Mndewa Mulungu kamlongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">“Kala mkono wangu wa kulume, hanhu ha nhogolwa na udaho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MRK 12:36">mbaka niwahume wahasanyi wako.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Kama Daudi mwenyego komkema Kilisito ‘Mndewa.’ Kodahaze Kilisito yawe mwanage?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yesu kowakomhokela wanhu waitiganye na Wafunda Ndagizi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matayo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka 20:45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Bumbila kulu dikala domtegeleza Yesu kwa ndeng'helo. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Viyakalile yofunda, Yesu kalonga, “Itiganyeni na wofunda ndagizi za Musa. Wao wogenda kuno wavala makanzu matali na wonda walamsigwe kwa nhogolwa mmagulilo. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Ivija wao wolonda wakale mvigoda va ulongozi mzing'anda za kuiting'hanila Wayahudi na kwing'higwa nyafasi za nhogolwa mzisona. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Wao woboka vinhu va wagane na ili waoneke kua watenda goya wopula kwa chipindi chitali. Kwa mbuli iyo wokwiza kulamuligwa hakulu ng'hani.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muke mgane yalavile nhosa vinogile</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka 21:1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu kakala behi na chia chakulavila nhosa hai ng'anda ya Mulungu na kulola bumbila da wanhu viwakalile wolava sente zao mchia icho. Weli na uzenzi mkulu walava sente nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Mbali muke mgane imwe kalava sente mbili za shaba. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Yesu kawakema waluko wake kawalongela, “Kweli nomlongeleni, muke mgane ino kalava hakulu muichia chino kubita wamwenga wose. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Wamwenga walava kuilinga na vija visigale muuzenzi wao, mbali muke mgane ino yeli chikumbi muyega, kalava vose viyeli navo, mbaka kija chiyalondile kuja muugima wake.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kolongelela kubomoligwa kwa ng'anda ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matayo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Yesu viyakalile yolawa hai ng'anda ya Mulungu, mwaluko wake imwe kamlongela, “Mfundaji! lola vija mabwe gano vigali makulu na mazengo viganogile!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Baho Yesu kamwidika kalonga, “Ivo, gwee kokanganya mazengo gano vigali makulu? Habule hata dibwe dimwe donda kusigala hachanha mwadibwe dimwenga, chila dibwe dobomoligwa.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matayo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu viyakalile kakala kulugongo lwa Mizeituni yoilola na ng'anda ya Mulungu, Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana na Andulea wainega wamuwinza Yesu na wamuuza, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tebu chilongele, mbuli zino zolawilila lini? Nachoni kilaguso cha kuchilagusa mbuli zino za behi kulawilila?<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu kasonga kuwalongela, “Itiganyeni na munhu yoyose seke yawavwizile. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Manake wanhu wengi wokwiza na kutumila Zina jangu na wolonga, ‘Iyo nie Kilisito,’ nao wowavwizila wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Mhahulika mbuli ya bung'hukila, hebu nongelela ya bung'hukila, seke mdumbe. Mbuli izo zokwiza kulawilila tu, mbali uja uhelelo ung'hali. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Wanhu wa isi imwe woitoa na wanhu wa isi imwenga hebu wanhu wa ufaume umwe woitoa na wanhu wa ufaume umwenga. Kolawila na mtigisiko hanhu hakwe hakwe na nzala kulu. Madununzo gago iyo kama mosi mwa usungu wa kulela.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Mbali mweye muitiganye. Manake wowagala mvitala na wowalibula na mibalati mzing'anda za kuitinganila wayahudi. Ivija molamuligwa haulongozi lwa wakulu na wafaume kwavija mweye mwa wajalusona wangu, ili kuwalongela mbuli zangu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Mbali kabula uhelelo kufika, tanhu Usenga Unogile uliguligwe kwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Wahamwamhani na kuwagala mvitala kulamuligwa, seke mgae kwa dakulonga. Longeni tu jojose donda mwing'higwe, kwavija sio mweye mulonga mbali Muhe wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Baho Munhu komhinduka ndugu yake ili yakomigwe, tata komhinduka mwanage yakomigwe. Wana wowatoa tata na mami zao mbaka wowakoma. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Wanhu wose wowalema kwavija mweye wajalusona wangu, mbali yonda yafunye moyo mbaka hauhelelo kohonyigwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madununzo makulu gokwiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matayo 24:15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Mhaona kinyolodo icho kima hanhu hahalondeka mui ng'anda ya Mulungu mvimanye kua hana chinhu chihile chogala ubananzi na hachilondeke kukala umo, mvimanye yogesa choni! Waja wanhu wali ku Yudea wakimbilile kulugongo. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Iyo yeli kuchanha mchiswili cha ng'anda yake seke ya hulumuke hasi hebu kwingila mng'anda kusola chochose. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Yeli kumgunda sekeyabwele ukae kusola valo jake. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Woluona wana chike weli na inda hebu waja wokong'heza mmazua gago! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Puleni Mulungu mbuli zino sekezilawilile msimo wa mbeho. <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Manake mazua gago wogaya ng'hani vija haina lawila hachisogo tangia baho Mulungu viyalumbile isi na mbaka lelo na hailawila kaidi mbee! <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Kama Mndewa sambi yahunguze mazua gago, habule munhu yoyose sambi yahonyigwe, mbali kwa chimo cha waja yawasagulige waiyeka, Mndewa kogahunguza mazua gago.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Mmazua gago munhu yoyose yahawalongela, ‘Loleni, Kilisito kakuno!’ hebu, ‘Loleni, kakuja!’ Sekemumtogole. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Manake wolawila wanhu woikema walagusi wa uvwizi na wamwenga woikema nie ‘Kilisito!’ Nao wosan'na vilaguso na uzonza ili kuwazaganya, ihadahika hata waja wasaguligwe waiyeka. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Ivo itiganyeni! Nie niwalongela mbuli zino kabula haganalawilila.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matayo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Mbali mmazua gago, kugala kuhamala, “Zua dogeligwa ziza na mwezi haulava bung'hulo jake, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />nhondo zogwa kulawa kuulanga, na baho vinhu vimwenga vili kuulanga votigisika.’ <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Leka wanhu wose vonda wamuone Mwanage Munhu viyeza mgamawingu kwa udaho mwingi na ukulu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Nayo kowalagiza Watumigwa wake wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu wawakunzanye wanhu wasaguligwe na Mulungu kulawa mhande zose nne za isi, kulawa muuhelelo mwa isi mbaka muuhelelo mwa ulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fundo kulawa mbiki wa Mtini</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matayo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Ifunzeni mfano uno kulawa mumbiki wa Mtini, mhaona makwamvi gake gochipuka na kulava mayani, movimanya kua msimo wa mulao wahabehi. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ivija, mhagaona gaja ganiwalongele golawilila, mvimanye kua Kilisito kahabehi kwiza na kamuulwivi. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Nomlongeleni kweli, wanhu wa ulelo uno haukwaga mbaka mbuli zino zose zilawilile. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Ulanga na isi wobita, mbali usenga wangu haukwaga mbee.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Habule munhu yovimanya zua hebu saa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matayo 24:36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Mbali kwa mbuli ya zua dijo na saa habule hata imwe yovimanya, hata watumigwa wa kuulanga kwa Mulungu hebu nie Mwana wa Munhu sivimanya, ila Tata yaiyeka. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Itiganyeni! Mkale meso mpula! kwavija hamvimanya saa ija yonda ivike. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Yokua kama munhu yeli muumwanza viyaileka ng'anda yake na kuwalagiza watumigwa wake wailole goya, amala kamlongela ija yokaliza ng'anda yokala muulwivi yakale meso. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />“Kwaivo itandeni kwavija hamvimanya kobwela lini mweneng'anda, kama ni chigulogulo, hebu chilo chizamile, hebu imitondo lukwili nzogolo yokwika, hebu usimbukilo wa zua. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Mkale meso kama yahalawila gafula, seke yeze kuwavika muwasa. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Dija diniwalongela mweye, ivija nowalongela wanhu wose ‘Muitande goya!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wamwikila kigwena kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Gakala gasigale mazua maidi tu kuvika lusona lwa Pasaka na lwa migate ija haigeligwe mela. Vilongozi wa walava nhambiko na wofunda ndagizi wakala wolonda nzila ya kumgoga Yesu kwa kwaubala na kumkoma. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Mbali wailongela, “Sekechitende mbuli ino mchipindi cha lusona lwa Pasaka, kwavija wanhu wodaha kugala heahea.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muke kombaka Yesu mavuta</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu kakala uko Betania muing'anda ya Simoni yakalile na utamu wa dikulu. Yesu viyakalile yoja ndia, muke imwe kengila yeli na nhyupa ilumbigwe kwa mabwe ga alibasta ili na mavuta ganung'ila na ya bei ng'hulu. Kaigubula nhyupa iyo, kagida kinung'ila icho mditwi da Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Wanhu wamwenga wakalile haja wagevuzika kwambuli iyo na wakala woilongela wenyego kwa wenyego, “Habali kudaalila mavuta gabei ng'hulu kama vino? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Mavuta gano gahadahile kuguligwa kwa bei ng'hulu kubita chitumetume cha munhu cha mwaka mgima na sente izo waheng'higwe vikumbi muyega.” Wamkomhokela ng'hani iyo muke.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Mbali Yesu kawalongela, “Habali momgaza? Mlekeni! Iyo kanhendela mbuli inogile. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Vikumbi muyega mokala nao mazua gose na modaha kuwataza saa yoyose yumlonda. Mbali nie sikala namweye mazua gose. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Muke ino kanitendela dija diyadahile. Kaugela lukuli lwangu mavuta ga kunung'ila kunitanda kwa kuwandigwa kwangu. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Nomlongeleni kweli, kwambuli ya kukumbukigwa muke ino, dino diyatendile dosimuliligwa hohose muiisi haja Usenga wa Mulungu hauliguligwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda katogola kumhinduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matayo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Amala Yuda munhu kulawa Kaliote, imwe mwa waluko wa Yesu kumi na waidi, kaita kwa walongozi wa walava nhambiko ili yamhinduke Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Vilongozi wa walava nhambiko wadeng'helela ng'hani kuhulika mbuli iyo na wamlalika kumwing'ha sente. Ivo yeye kakala yolonda nyafasi inogile ili yadahe kuwataza kumwamha.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koja ndia ya lusona lwa Pasaka na waluko wake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matayo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka 22:7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Vidivikile zua da mosi da lusona lwa Migate haigeligwe mela, zua diwazoele kuchinja bung'hukilalo wa Pasaka, waluko wa Yesu wamuuza, “Kolonda chiitehi chikakutandile hakujila Pasaka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Amala Yesu kawalagiza waidi mwa waja waluko wake, kawalongela, “Gendeni muikae, uko moiting'hanila na mulume kapapa nongo da mazi. Muwinzeni, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mbaka kuyokwingila. Mlongeleni mwenekae wa ng'anda ija yokwingila, ‘Mfundaji kouza, chakulihi chumba cha nyambenyambe icho chinonda kujila Pasaka hamwe na waluko wangu? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Nayo kowalagusila chumba kikulu chakudigolofa, chimala kwikigwa goya. Chitandileni umo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Waja waluko wasegela waita kuikae, nao wavika chila chinhu ivija kama viyawalongele. Ivo waitanda ndia ya lusona lwa Pasaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Hadiswele zua, Yesu keza na waja waluko wake kumi na waidi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Viwakalile woja Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela kweli, kuna munhu imwe mmwenu iyoja hamwe na nie iyo konihinduka.” <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Waja waluko wasonga kulumila mmoyo na kumuuza imwe imwe, “Mndewa! Kolonga nie?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Kawedika, “Imwe mmwenu mweye kumi na waidi, ija yozang'iza mgate mdibakuli hamwe na nie. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Nie Mwana wa Munhu nolondeka nife kama viyandikiligwe. Mbali koluona munhu ija yonihinduka nie Mwana wa Munhu! Vihanogile ng'hani munhu iyo maza seke yaleligwe!”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndia ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matayo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Viwakalile woja, Yesu kasola gate, kamwing'ha hewela Mulungu, kaubanzula na kuweng'ha waluko wake kalonga, “Soleni mje, uno uwo lukuli lwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Amala kasola chikombe chili na divai, kamwing'ha Mulungu hewela, kaweng'ha waluko wake, wose wang'wila umo. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Kawalongela, “Ino iyo damu yangu ilagusa Lagano da Mulungu na wanhu wake, ikwitika kwa mbuli ya wengi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Nomlongeleni kweli, sing'wa kaidi divai mbaka zua dija nihang'wa mu Ufaume wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Amala Yesu na waluko wake wemba wila wa kumtogola Mulungu, viwamalile kwimba wila, walawa waita ku Lugongo lwa Mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagusa kua Petulo kokwiza kumbela</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Viwakalile nzila Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mose mong'imbila na kunyasa, kama viyandikigwe mmayandiko manang'hana Mulungu kalonga, ‘Nomtoa msusilaji na bung'hukilalo wopwililika.’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Mbali nihamala kuzilibuka, nowalongolela kuita Galilaya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Baho Petulo kalonga, “Hata wakuleke wose, mbali si nie.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yesu kamlongela, “Nokulongela kweli, chilo cha lelo, kabula nzogolo hanakwika mala ya kaidi, kombela mala ndatu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Mbali Petulo kagangamiza kulonga, “Hata kama ihalondeka kufa na gweye, nie sikubela.” Na waja waluko wamwenga wabwelela kulonga ivo ivo.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kopula Mulungu uko kudikonde da Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matayo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Waita hanhu hokemigwa Getisemani, Yesu kawalongela waluko wake, “Kaleni hano nie noita kumpula Mulungu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Amala kawasola Petulo, Yakobo na Yohana kailongoza nao hamwande chidogo. Nayo kasonga kwingila giogio na kugutilila. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Kawalongela, “Moyo wangu una giogio kulu na dodaha kunikoma. Sigaleni hano na mkale meso.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Yesu kakwesa hamwande chidogo, kagwa chifudifudi na kupula kalonga, “Kama ihadahika seke nibitile saa ino ya madununzo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Kalonga, “Tataangu, gose godahika kumwako. Nisegezele chikombe chino cha madununzo, sio kama vinilonda nie, mbali sang'hana vija vuulonda gweye.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Amala kabwela kwa waluko wake waja wadatu kawavika wawasa, nayo kamlongela Simoni yokemigwa Petulo, “Simoni, kuwasa? Ivo, hudahile kukala meso hata saa dimwe tu? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Mkale meso na mpule sekemgezigwe kutenda malozo. Mweye molonda ila ng'huli zenu zabule ludabwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Kabwela kaidi kupula yolonga mbuli iija. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Viyabwelile kwa waluko wake, kawavika wawasa kaidi, kwavija meso gao gakala gazamile nhongo. Nao hawamanyile dakumlongela.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Kabwela mala ya kadatu, kawalongela, “Mng'hali muwasa na kuhumula? Imala iyo kuwasa! Zua divika. Lola! Nie Mwanage Munhu nogogigwa nogeligwa kwa wanhu weli na malozo. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Ivo imeni chiteni! Lola ija yonihinduka kokwiza!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Yesu viyakalile yang'hali yolonga, Yuda, imwe mwa waja waluko kumi na waidi wa Yesu, kalawila yeli na bumbila kulu da wanhu wamhile mapanga na malungu. Wanhu wao wakalile walagizigwe na walongozi wa walava nhambiko na wafunza ndagizi za Musa na wavele. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Ivo Yuda, ija yamhinduke, kakala kaweng'ha kilaguso waja wanhu kua, “Ija yonda nimlamse kwa kumhagatila, iyo mumwamhe na mumsole yeli muwamilizi wenu.” <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ivo Yuda viyavikile, kamuwinza Yesu kamlamusa, “Mfundaji!” Amala kumnonela. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Waja wanhu wamwamha Yesu, wamwika muwamizilizi wao. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Baho imwe mwa waja wakalile wemile behi na Yesu kasomola panga jake na kamkwapula gutwi mtumigwa wa Mkulu wa walava nhambiko. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Amala Yesu kawalongela, “Mwiza kunyamha na mapanga na malungu kama vija nie na mbavi? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Mazua gose chikala hamwe na mweye nowafunda wanhu mui ng'anda ya Mulungu hamnyamhile. Mbali leka mayandiko gavikile.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Baho waluko wake wose wamleka, wakimbila. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Baho hakala na Mbwanga imwe, yakalile kaigwasika golole zelu, kakala komuwinza Yesu, wageza kumwamha, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />mbali iyo kapulusuka kalagaza golole jake, kakimbila mwazi.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu haulongozi wa chitala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matayo 26:57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luka 22:54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Wamgala Yesu mng'anda mwa Mkulu wa walava nhambiko, na uko walongozi wa walava nhambiko, wavele na wafundaji wa ndagizi waiting'hanila hamwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petulo kamkoleleza kwa kutali, mbaka halubuga la Mkulu wa nhambiko. Uko kakala hamwe na wamilizi, kokotela moto. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Vilongozi wa walava nhambiko na wasenga wose wa Chitala wakala wolonda wapate mbuli ya kumgoga Yesu ili wamkome, mbali hawapatile. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Wengi wamlavila mbuli za uvwizi Yesu, mbali mbuli zao wose haziilumba.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Amala wamwenga wenuka wamlavila mbuli za uvwizi, walonga, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Cheye chimhulika viyalonga, ‘Nie nobomola ng'anda ya Mulungu izengigwe na wanhu na mmazua madatu noizenga imwenga iyo haizengigwa na wanhu.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Mbali hata ivo, mbuli zao haziilumbile. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Baho Mkulu wa walava nhambiko kema haulongozi wa chitala kamuuza Yesu, “Ivo, gweye hudaha kuwedika? Ivo, wanhu wano wose wokulongeleza choni?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Mbali Yesu kanyamala hupii, halongile mbuli yoyose. Mkulu wa walava nhambiko kamuuza kaidi, “Ivo, gweye iyo Kilisito, Mwana wa Mulungu ija yotogoligwa?” <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu kawedika, “Nie iyo. Namweye moniona nie Mwanage Munhu vinikala mkono wa kulume mwa Mulungu yeli na udaho, na niheza mgamawingu gali kuulanga kwa Mulungu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Mkulu wa walava nhambiko kadega vivalo vake kwa kulagusa ludoko, kalonga, “Ivo, cholonda yelihi kaidi yeze achilongele mbuli yake? <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mweye wenyego muhulika viyafukula. Mweye momlamulaze baho?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Wose walamula kua kolondeka yafe.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Amala wanhu wamwenga wasonga kumtemela mate, wamfunga kumbi mmeso, wamtoa mang'hua na kumlongela, “Lagusa yelihi yakutoile! Wamilizi wamsola wamtoa mang'hua.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matayo 26:69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Petulo viyakalile yang'hali halubuga, keza mtumigwa imwe wa chike kulawa mwa watumigwa wa Mkulu wa Walava nhambiko. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Viyamuonile Petulo yokotela moto, kamkodolela meso, kamlongela, “Gweye ivija kukala hamwe na Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Mbali Petulo kabela, kalonga,“Aka ngobole simmanya na sikimanya chuulonga.” Amala Petulo kahalawa kaita kuinzila ya kwingilila. Baho nzogolo kakwika.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ija mtumigwa wa chike viyamuonile Petulo baho, kawalongela kaidi waja wemile baho, “Munhu ino nayo wahamwe.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Mbali Petulo kabela kaidi. Hamwande chidogo waja wakalile wemile behi na Petulo wamlongela, “Mbali kweli gweye kwahamwe nayo, manake gweye nayo kwa munhu wa Galilaya!” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Petulo kasonga kuiduila na kuilahila, kawalongela, “Simmanyile munhu ino yumlongelela mbuli zake.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Bahaja nzogolo kakwika mala yakaidi. Baho Petulo kakumbuka mbuli ija Yesu iyamulongele, “Kabula nzogolo hanakwika mala ya kaidi, kombela mala nhatu.” Ivo kavimanya viyatendile, kalila ng'hani.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohana 18:28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Imitondo lukwili, chitala chose manake wakulu wa walava nhambiko na wavele vilongozi na wofunda ndagizi za Musa, waitogolela hamwe. Wamfunga Yesu, wamsola na kumgala kwa Pilato yakalile Kilongozi wa Kilumi. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato kamuuza, “Ivo, gweye iyo Mfaume wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Yesu kamwidika, “Kama gweye mwenyego vuulonga.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Wakulu wa walava nhambiko wamlongeleza Yesu kwa mbuli nyingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Mbali Pilato kamuuza kaidi Yesu, “Ivo, kwabule da kuwedika? Lola mbuli nyingahi ziwakulongeleza.”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Mbali Yesu hagendelele kuwedika, baho Pilato kakanganya.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato kalamula ifa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matayo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yohana 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19:16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Ikala mazoela gake Pilato chila chipindi cha Pasaka komvugulila mfungigwa imwe mdigeleza ija iwamlonda wanhu. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Chipindi icho munhu imwe yokemigwa Balaba kakala yafungigwe mdigeleza hamwe na wabananzi wayage waswangize wanhu kutenda ubananzi na kukoma. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Dija bumbila da wanhu dimwizila Pilato na kumpula yawatendele kama vigali mazoela gake. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato kawauza, “Molonda niwalekesele ino Mfaume wa Wayahudi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Manake Pilato kavimanya kua wakulu wa walava nhambiko wakala wamgoga na kumgala kumwake yamlamule kwa mbuli ya maya zao.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Mbali wakulu wa walava nhambiko wawaswangiza wanhu waja wamemile wampule yawalekesele Balaba badili ya Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato kawauza kaidi, “Ivo monda nimtendele choni ino munhu imumkema Mfaume wa Wayahudi?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Watoa nyangi walonga, “Muwambeni mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Mbali Pilato kawauza, “Habali? Kabananga choni?” Mbali wao waguta nyangi kwa kuiyoha ng'hani, wolonga, “Muwambeni mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato kalonda yaweng'he ndeng'helelo wanhu waja wamemile, kawalekesela Balaba, nayo kalagiza Yesu yalibuligwe mbalati, na kamlava ili wamuwambe.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamilizi wamzeha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matayo 27:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Wamilizi wamsola Yesu waita nayo mui ng'anda ya Pilato, ng'anda iyo yokemigwa Plaitolio. Umo wakunzanya bumbila jose da wamilizi. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Wamvaza Yesu golole da zambalau manake valo da Kifaume, wazinga kigalama cha miwa, wamvaza Yesu mditwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Wasonga kumlamsa kwa kumzeha, “Mwinyi, Mfaume wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Wamtoa kwa mibalati ya midete kwa kubwelela kaidi na kaidi mditwi na kumtemela mate. Wamfugamila mmagulu gake kwa kumzeha. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Amala viwamalile kumzeha, wamhambula dija golole da zambalau, wamvaza valo jake mwenyego. Amala wamlava kunze ili wakamuwambe mumsalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wamiizi womuwamba Yesu mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Munhu imwe kulawa kae ya Kilene zina jake Simoni, tata yao kina Alekizanda na Lufo, kakala yobita nzila ya kwingila muikae kulawa kumgunda, wamilizi wamswangiza yaupape uja msalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Amala wamgala Yesu mbaka hanhu hokemigwa Goligota, iyo manake ni hanhu ha vuha da ditwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Nao wamwing'ha divai ihanganyigwe na dawa ya mbiki wa manemane, mbali Yesu kalema kung'wa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Amala wamuwamba, na vivalo vake wavigola kwa kuvitoela simbi. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Ikala yovika saa nhatu imitondo viwamuwambile Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Mbuli yakuwambigwa kwake yandikigwa vino, “Mfaume wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Wamwamba Yesu hamwe na wanhu wabavi waidi, imwe msalaba wa ubanzi wake wa kulume imwenga msalaba wa ubanzi wa kumoso. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Baho gaja mayandiko gandikigwe galinganya, “Kahanganyigwa hamwe na wabananzi.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">28 Mayandiko gamwenga ga umwaka gabule msitali uno</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Wanhu wakalile wobita nzila behi nawo watigisa matwi gao na kumzeha wolonga,“Enaa! Gweye ulongile kodaha kuibomola ng'anda ya Mulungu na kuizenga kwa mazua madatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />uihonye mwenyego hulumuka mumsalaba.” <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Ivija wakulu wa walava nhambiko hamwe na wafunda ndagizi za Musa wamzeha wamwenga wailongela, “Iyo kawahonya wamwenga, mbali hadaha kuihonya mwenyego! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Waja Mafalisayo na wafunda ndagizi za Musa walonga, kama iyo Kilisito Mfaume wa Waizilaeli, na yahulumuke lelo mumsalaba, ili chilole na kumtogola.” Waja wawambigwe hamwe nao wamliga.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kadanganika mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Viivikile saa sita, ziza digubika isi yose kwa masaa madatu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Muisaa tisa Yesu kaguta ndilo kwa dizi kulu, kalonga,“Eloi, Eloi lama Sabakitani?” Manake, “Mulungu wangu, Mulungu wangu mbona kunileka?” <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Wanhu wamwenga wemile behi nayo viwahulike mbuli iyalongile, walonga, “Tegelezeni komkema Elia.” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Munhu imwe kalopola, kazabika siponchi mui divai yaugwadu, kaika mdidete, kamwing'ha Yesu yang'we kalonga, “Tebu mulekeni, chilole kama Elia kokwiza kumlava kulawa baho mumsalaba.” <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Amala Yesu kalila kwa dizi kulu, na kadanganika. <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Golole dikalaile doning'inila hanhu hanhang'hane mwi ng'anda ya Mulungu didegeka vihande vidi kulawila kuchanha mbaka hasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Baho ija mlongozi wa wamilizi, yakalile kema haulongozi ha msalaba wa Yesu, viyahulike ija dizi yake na viyalolile viyakala yodanganika, kalonga, “Kweli munhu ino kakala Mwana wa Mulungu!” <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Hakala na wanachike wamwenga wakalile wolola kwa kutali, umo wakala baho Malia kulawa kae ya Magidala, na Malia mami yao Yakobo mdodo na Yose, ivija kakala baho na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Wanachike wano waisondelela na Yesu na kumhunganikila viyakalile Galilaya. Ivija hakala na wanachike wamwenga wengi wakalile weza hamwe nayo Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowandigwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Viivikile chigulogulo, kwavija dikala zua da kuitanda kabula ya zua da kuhumula Wayahudi, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yusufu munhu kulawa Alimataya yakalile yotogoligwa mchitala, nayo mwenyego kakala koubeta kwiza kwa Ufaume wa Mulungu, kamuwinza Pilato bila kudumba na kumpula yeng'higwe lukuli lwa Yesu ili yakauwande. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato kakanganya kuhulika Yesu tiyali kadanganika. Ivo kamkema ija mlongozi wa wamilizi, kamuuza kama Yesu kakala tiyali kadanganika. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Viyahulike kulawa kwa ija mlongozi wa wamilizi kua kweli Yesu kadanganika tiyali, Pilato kamleka Yusufu yausole lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Baho Yusufu kagula sitili nzelu chinang'hane, kauhulumula lukuli lwa Yesu mumsalaba, kauzinga ija sitili inang'hane kawika mdipanga disongoligwe mdibwe. Amala kabimbilisa dibwe kulu kugubika haulwivi lwakwingilila mdipanga. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Malia kulawa kae ya Magdala na Malia mamiyake Yose wahaona hanhu haja hayagonezigwe Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kuzilibuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Hadiswele zua da kuhumula da Wayahudi, Maliamu kulawa Magidala na Maliamu mamiyake Yakobo na Salome wagula mavuta ga kunung'ila waita kuubaka lukuli lwa Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Imitondo lukwili, zua da jumapili, waita kudipanga da Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Viwawile mnzila wakala woiuza, walonga “Yelihi yonda yachibimbilisile dibwe dija kulawa haulwivi lwa panga. <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Mbali viwawile behi kuvika, wadiona dibwe dija kulu, dimala dibimbilisigwa kulawa haukwingilila hadipanga. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Viwakalile wokwingila mja mdipanga, wamuona mbwanga yavalile golole zelu kakala yakalile ubanzi wa kulume, nawo wakanganya ng'hani. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Mbwanga ija kawalongela, “Seke mdumbe. Momzahila Yesu, kulawa Nazaleti, yawambigwe. Kazilibuka! Kahabule hano. Loleni hanhu hawamtambalize. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Mbali gendeni mkawalongele waluko wake sekemswele Petulo kua ‘Kowalongolela koita Galilaya, uko momuona, kama viyawalongele.’ ” <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Amala walawa mja mdipanga kwakukimbila, wadumba ng'hani kwa gudemo na ng'hanganyo ng'hulu ikala iwamha, nao hawamlongele munhu yoyose mbuli yoyose.<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamlawila Maliamu kulawa Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matayo 28:9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yohana 20:11-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yesu viyazilibuke lukwili ya zua da jumapili, mosi kamlawila Maliamu kulawa Magidala, ija yakalile kamlava vinyamkela saba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:9 </char></note> <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Iyo Maliamu kulawa Magidala kaita kuwalongela waja wakalile woisondelela na Yesu, waja wakalilile wolila na kulombokeza nayo. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Mbali viwahulike kua Yesu mgima na kua Maliamu kamuona, hawamtogole.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Kawalawila waluko waidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka 24:13-35</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Hamwande Yesu kawalawila waluko waidi mwa waja waluko kumi na waidi woita kumgunda kuno kakala na chihanga tafauti. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Nao waluko waja waidi viwammanyile, wabwela na kuwalongela wayao. Mbali wao hawawatogolele ivija.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawila waluko waja kumi na moja</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sang’hano za Wasenga 1:6-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Amala Yesu kawalawila waja waluko wake kumi na moja viwakalile woja ndia. Kawakomhokela kwa udala wa mioyo yao na kuleka kutogola gaja gawalongiligwe na waja wamuonile. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Baho Yesu kawalongela, “Gendeni muiisi yose, mkaligule Usenga unogile kwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yoyose yonda kutogola na kubatizigwa iyo kohonyigwa. Mbali yoyose ija honda kutogola kohukumigwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Waja wamtogole Kilisito wosang'hana vilaguso vino, kwa kutumila udaho wa Zina jangu wolava vinyamkela, wolonga kwa ulonzi umwenga, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />wogoga nyoka kwa makono gao na hata wahang'wa kinhu chochose cha kukoma, hakiwakoma mbee, wowekila watamu makono kuwapulila, nao wohona.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kenuligwa kuita kuulanga kwa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sang’hano za Wasenga 1:9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Yesu viyamalile kulonga nao, kenuligwa kuita kuchanha kwa Mulungu na kakala ubanzi wa nhogolwa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Amala waluko wake walawa, waita kila hanhu kuligula Usenga Unogile, nayo Mndewa kawataza kasang'hana sang'hano, na kutenda vilaguso, ivo kuulagusa Usenga wake kua ni kweli.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>